(24, 'Choose To Challenge - IWD 2021', 1, 'y', NULL, '<p>International Women&#39;s Day - March 8, 2021</p>\r\n\r\n<p>March 8 is a global day celebrating the social, economic, cultural, and political achievements of women. <br>\r\nThe day also marks a call to action for accelerating gender equality in every field.  </p>\r\n\r\n<p>In association with <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/iwd2021?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZUttw0o7VCsinTPdZabhhqEmo9OnSm7YRwH_Va97XqEwEgU3Tqrw4ZaML76Q8E17xzGEsSTLU042fyBI8iPUCfqO1bj5ed67cZLpKPl75GWbjyeUj6P7yGg795y-aZIHWJcrBaM4h678ktyl4zLbWg7I1ae26KLsAD4DbJTfjcehw&__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">#IWD2021</a>, we invited each and everyone to join hands with us to choose to challenge & call out gender bias, stereotypes & discrimination. We stood in solidarity for a <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/genderequal?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZUttw0o7VCsinTPdZabhhqEmo9OnSm7YRwH_Va97XqEwEgU3Tqrw4ZaML76Q8E17xzGEsSTLU042fyBI8iPUCfqO1bj5ed67cZLpKPl75GWbjyeUj6P7yGg795y-aZIHWJcrBaM4h678ktyl4zLbWg7I1ae26KLsAD4DbJTfjcehw&__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">#genderequal</a> world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We were overwhelmed by the number of responses we received for <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/choosetochallenge?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZUttw0o7VCsinTPdZabhhqEmo9OnSm7YRwH_Va97XqEwEgU3Tqrw4ZaML76Q8E17xzGEsSTLU042fyBI8iPUCfqO1bj5ed67cZLpKPl75GWbjyeUj6P7yGg795y-aZIHWJcrBaM4h678ktyl4zLbWg7I1ae26KLsAD4DbJTfjcehw&__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">#ChoosetoChallenge</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.natyasutraonline.com/picture-gallery/international-womens-day-2021\">Check out our gallery for more.</a> </p>', 'International Women\'s Day 2021', NULL, 0, 0, 'd', NULL, 'choose-to-challenge-iwd-2021.jpg', NULL, 'Choose To Challenge - IWD 2021', NULL, '', NULL, '', 0, 0, '2021-02-18 11:44:44', 4, '61.2.215.254', '2021-04-12 04:30:16', 4, '223.227.52.238', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'iwd2021', 'Join hands for a Gender Equal world!', 'women\'s day, gender equality, community engagement', 'We invite everyone to take part in IWD activity by posting challenges they had to face.'),
