(30, 'Kuchipudi Beginners Lessons', 1, 'y', NULL, '<p>Kuchipudi, one among the eight major Indian classical dance forms, traces back its traditions in the Krishna district of Andhra Pradesh.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Originated in the 17th century, it has its roots in the ancient art form of Yakshagana. The core tenets of the modern-day art form were laid by Siddhendra Yogi with his creation of the dance-drama Bhama Kalapam.<br>\r\nSreelakshmy Govardhanan welcomes all students to the course as she briefly outlines the course structure and introduces the art form and its history.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&lt;meta charset=\"utf-8\" /&gt;</p>', NULL, NULL, 25, 56, 'd', NULL, '', NULL, 'Kuchipudi Beginners Lessons', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, '2021-03-20 11:24:28', 4, '61.2.215.254', '2021-03-20 11:28:26', 4, '61.2.215.254', '2021-03-20 11:28:46', 4, '61.2.215.254', 'kuchipudi-beginners-lessons', 'Kuchipudi Beginners Lessons', 'Kuchipudi, online dance, indian classical dance', 'Kuchipudi Beginners Lessons by Sreelakshmy Govardhanan'),
(31, 'Kuchipudi Beginners Lessons', 1, 'n', NULL, '<p>Kuchipudi, one among the eight major Indian classical dance forms, traces back its traditions in the Krishna district of Andhra Pradesh.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Originated in the 17th century, it has its roots in the ancient art form of Yakshagana. The core tenets of the modern-day art form were laid by Siddhendra Yogi with his creation of the dance-drama Bhama Kalapam.<br>\r\nSreelakshmy Govardhanan welcomes all students to the course as she briefly outlines the course structure and introduces the art form and its history.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.natyasutraonline.com/kuchipudi/sreelakshmy-govardhanan/beginners-online-lessons\">Click here for complete lessons</a></p>', NULL, NULL, 25, 56, 'd', NULL, '', NULL, 'Kuchipudi Beginners Lessons', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2021-03-20 11:32:05', 4, '61.2.215.254', '2023-02-24 07:23:45', 1, '61.2.215.254', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'kuchipudi-beginners-lessons', 'Kuchipudi Beginners Lessons', 'Kuchipudi, Beginners Dance Lessons,\r\nSreelakshmy Govardhanan, Indian Classical Dance', 'Kuchipudi Beginners Lessons by Sreelakshmy Govardhanan'),
(32, 'Navarasa Kauthwam', 1, 'n', NULL, '<p>The Navarasas form the basis of Rasa-abhinaya in Indian classical dances.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>They are used to convey various emotions through a variety of facial expressions and hand gestures. The nine emotions are The Rasas included in the composition are Shringara, Raudra, Karuna, Hasya, Bibhatsa, Bhayanaka, Veera, Adbutha and Shantha.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The entire program is subdivided into thirty videos spread across nine sections. Each part is individually introduced, beginning with detailed explanations by the Guru. Every rasa, its significance, and inherent meaning is carefully showcased. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.natyasutraonline.com/bharatanatyam/rajashreewarrier/master-class-navarasa-kauthwam\">Click here for complete lessons</a></p>', NULL, NULL, 18, 69, 'd', NULL, '', NULL, 'Navarasa Kauthwam', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2021-05-11 09:36:03', 4, '103.155.222.94', '2023-02-24 07:23:31', 1, '61.2.215.254', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'navarasa-kauthwam', 'Learn Navarasa Kauthwam by Rajashree Warrier', 'Rajashree Warrier, Navarasa Kauthwam, Bharatanatyam, Master Class, Online Dance Class', 'Learn Navarasa Kauthwam online, a Bharatanatyam composition Master Class by Rajashree Warrier'),
