(55, 'Breathe, Dance, Celebrate', 1, 'n', NULL, '<p>Mark World Environment Day with Shwasam – A New Class by Rama Vaidyanathan<br>\r\n<br>\r\nOn the occasion of World Environment Day this June 5th,  Natyasutra is proud to release Shwasam, a new Bharatanatyam class by acclaimed dancer and choreographer Rama Vaidyanathan. Rooted in the timeless verses of Thirumoolar’s Thirumandiram, this composition celebrates the breath as the first rhythm of life-a sacred link between the dancer and the cosmos. Rama Vaidyanathan brings a unique philosophical and artistic vision to this piece, one where every breath becomes a step in the eternal dance of the universe.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWith detailed video lessons, in-depth demonstrations, a complete performance, and an original music composition by Dr. S. Vasudevan, Shwasam is now available exclusively on Natyasutraonline.com. This launch on World Environment Day is a reminder of the rhythms that connect us to nature, the self, and the divine. Visit our platform to begin learning this profound and meditative work.</p>', NULL, NULL, 16, 178, 'd', NULL, 'breathe-dance-celebrate.jpg', 'Rama Vaidyanathan', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-05-26 05:34:47', 19, '49.37.224.72', '2025-07-08 10:44:52', 19, '49.37.227.23', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'swasam-a-new-class-by-rama-vaidyanathan', 'Shwasam by Rama Vaidyanathan – New Bharatanatyam Class | Natyasutra', 'Shwasam, Bharatanatyam class, Rama Vaidyanathan, Swasam, Natyasutra, World Environment Day dance, Thirumandiram, Thirumoolar, classical dance online, Indian dance tutorial, spiritual dance, Bharatanatyam performance, Dr. S. Vasudevan music', 'Celebrate World Environment Day with Shwasam, a new Bharatanatyam class by Rama Vaidyanathan on Natyasutraonline.com. Inspired by Thirumoolar’s Thirumandiram, this spiritual composition explores breath as the first rhythm of life. Includes lessons, performance, and original music by Dr. S. Vasudevan.'),
(56, 'Natyasutra Guru Pranam 2025', 1, 'n', NULL, '<p>In a heartfelt celebration of Guru Purnima, Natyasutra, the online platform for learning Indian classical dance, paid tribute to legendary Odissi exponent and Padma Shri awardee Madhavi Mudgal through a special Guru Pranam ceremony. The honour was conferred by renowned Mohiniyattam dancer Dr. Neena Prasad, on behalf of Natyasutra, in recognition of Mudgal’s unparalleled contribution to the world of Indian classical dance.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nA foremost disciple of the iconic Guru Kelucharan Mohapatra, Madhavi Mudgal is acclaimed worldwide for her lyrical command of the Odissi form, her deep aesthetic sensibility, and her efforts to bring the tradition to global stages. Her illustrious accolades include the Padma Shri, the Sangeet Natak Akademi Award, and international honours such as the Grande Médaille de la Ville awarded by the Government of France.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe Guru Pranam ceremony was a symbolic gesture that reflects Natyasutra’s continued commitment to honouring the lineage of classical dance and the gurus who sustain its vitality. Through initiatives like these, Natyasutra continues to celebrate the timeless values of Indian classical arts, while preserving their essence for the digital age.</p>', NULL, NULL, 33, 184, 'd', 'natyasutra-guru-pranam-2025.jpg', 'natyasutra-guru-pranam-20251.jpg', 'Dr. Neena Prasad honours Odissi legend and Padma Shri awardee Madhavi Mudgal', 'Padma Shri Madhavi Mudgal during Natyasutra’s Guru Pranam ceremony on Guru Purnima', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2025-07-07 08:39:14', 19, '49.37.227.36', '2026-06-29 04:08:42', 19, '223.181.12.45', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'guru-pranamam', 'Natyasutra Honours Padma Shri Madhavi Mudgal with Guru Pranam 2025', 'Guru Pranam 2025, Guru Purnima, Madhavi Mudgal, Padma Shri Madhavi Mudgal, Odissi dance, Indian classical dance, Natyasutra, www.natyasutraonline.com, Guru Pranamam, Mohiniyattam, Dr. Neena Prasad, Kelucharan Mohapatra, Grande Médaille de la Ville, Invis Multimedia, Invis Pvt Ltd, digital archive Indian dance, classical dance tribute, Indian dance legends, Odissi exponent, Indian performing arts, Indian dance preservation, online Indian dance learning, Odissi guru, classical dance ceremony', 'In a heartfelt celebration of Guru Purnima, Natyasutra paid tribute to legendary Odissi exponent and Padma Shri awardee Madhavi Mudgal through a special Guru Pranam ceremony. The honour was conferred by renowned Mohiniyattam dancer Dr. Neena Prasad, on behalf of Natyasutra, in recognition of Mudgal’s unparalleled contribution to the world of Indian classical dance.'),
