(8, 'Yamini The Night', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Yamini – The Night, the soft soothing Flute recital by Dr. P. Padmesh', '<p>Yamini - The Night, is a soft soothing flute  rendition by Dr. P. Padmesh. The intriguing darkness, the enigmatic beauty, the rhapsody of silence... Each night brings a new experience - varied, unique, mystical yet transcending the individual. The night is also universal and eternal, leading all humanity into a new day and new hope. <br></p>', 'yamini.jpg', 'yamini.jpg', 'yamini.jpg', 'Flute', '2009-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'yamini-the-night', 'Yamini  The Night, Flute recital by Dr. P. Padmesh', 'Yamini,  padmesh, flute, Flute Recital,Flute Music,Padmesh,indian flute instrumental music free download,flute music indian,flute music audio,flute music - youtube,best flute music,relaxing music,flute music,Music ,flute types,flute for beginners,flute sound, free music, indian classical music, free classical music downloads, free download most popular classical music, classical music songs, classical music for studying, classical musical instrument,musical instrument, invis multimedia,', 'Yamini  The Night, the soft soothing Flute recital by Dr. P. Padmesh', '2020-06-04 10:25:18', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-16 11:01:40', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(9, 'Onappattukal', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Onappattukal, The Traditional Onam Songs sung during Onam season season offers a glimpse of the bygone days under King Mahabali which were filled with happiness and prosperity.', '<p>Onappattukal, traditional Onam songs, sung during Onam season offers a glimpse of the bygone days under King Mahabali which were filled with happiness and prosperity. The songs are a heartfelt prayer for restoring the glories of the bygone era. Onappattukal also rekindle hopes in the minds of the people filling them with the spirit of the festivity.The nine  Onam songs (Onappattukal) presented here  aptly capture the mood of Kerala during the Onam season.<br><br>Research & Music:  Dr. Leela Omchery & Dr. Deepti Omchery Bhalla<br>Vocal:  Geeta Rajendran, Aruna Thampi, Suresh<br>Veena:  Maya Varma<br>Violin:  Vrinda Varma<br>Edakka:  Satheesh Poduwal<br>Mridangam:  Muttara N. Rajendran<br><br></p>', 'onappattukal1.jpg', 'onappattukal.jpg', 'onappattukal.jpg', 'Malayalam', '2006-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'onappattukal-onam-songs-kerala', 'Onappattukal, Onappattukal, The Traditional Onam Songs of Kerala', 'Onappattukal, Poli poli poli poliyo, Onappattukal , Onnanam kochu Thumbi, Thumpippaattu,  Pathamudayathiruvona , Onnanam mathilakathu onnilallo, Enthu thumbi nee thullathirikkunnu , Onappattukal, onam songs, Kanyapooja, Thumbippaattu, Chadangupaattu, King Mahabali, onapattukal malayalam, onapattukal lyrics, onapattukal malayalam free download, onapattukal malayalam group songs, onapattukal malayalam youtube, onam pattukal, onam songs mp3, festival, harvest festival, folk song, malayali, keralite, Malayalam devotional song, hindu devotional song', 'Download Onappattukal, The Traditional Onam Songs sung during Onam season season offers a glimpse of the bygone days under King Mahabali which were filled with happiness and prosperity.', '2020-06-04 12:09:45', 1, '223.228.163.145', '2020-06-20 05:52:40', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(10, 'Samarpanam', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Memories reside in the depths of your heart, living and breathing like you and me. To sit down with them and savour the flavours of bygone days…what bliss! Samarpanam brings to you the forgotten music of your past.', '<p>The beauty of the past is held sacred and safe within the contours of those vague yet poignant things called memories. To slip away from time to time into the warm affections of the past is blissful to say the least. Samarpanam offers to steal you away into their enchanting world.<br><br></p>', 'samarpanam.jpg', 'samarpanam.jpg', 'samarpanam.jpg', 'violin', '2014-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'samarpanam', 'Samarpanam, the music of memories,  violin recital by Jayadevan', 'smarpanam, violin, music, jayadevan, music of memories, memories violin mp3 download, memories violin ringtone, violin cover, memories lyrics, someone you loved violin, how to play on violin,  instrumental violin, violin recital, violin recital program, violin music, violin music ringtone, violin music mp3 download, beautiful violin music, violin music notes, violin music for beginners, indian classical music, free classical music downloads, free download most popular classical music, classical music songs, classical music for studying, classical musical instrument,musical instrument, invis multimedia,', 'Violin recital by Jayadevan,  the music of memories - flowing from the past in to the present and on to the future. a mellifluous tribute to the golden memeories of bygone days.', '2020-06-04 15:02:12', 1, '223.228.163.145', '2020-06-18 05:52:20', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(11, 'Samagamam', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Samagamam - Eternal Confluence, A sweet reunion with the beloved after the bitter pangs of seperation. Violin rendition by A. Jayadevan', '<p>Samagamam – eternal confluence, is a violin rendition by A. Jayadevan. His music is noted for one of the most elegant feelings of life, a sweet reunion with the beloved after the bitter pangs of separation. The tinkling of an anklet, the soft fall of a footstep, the lilt of a familiar voice…journeys end in lovers’ meeting. <br></p>', 'samagamam2.jpg', 'samagamam.jpg', 'samagamam2.jpg', 'violin', '2009-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'samagamam', 'Samagamam - eternal confluence, violin rendition by A. Jayadevan', 'samagamam, violin, jayadevan,  eternal confluence, violin cover, how to play on violin,  instrumental violin, violin recital, violin recital program, violin music, violin music ringtone, violin music mp3 download, beautiful violin music, violin music notes, violin music for beginners, indian classical music, free classical music downloads, free download most popular classical music, classical music songs, classical music for studying, classical musical instrument,musical instrument, invis multimedia,', 'Samagamam - Eternal Confluence, A sweet reunion with the beloved after the bitter pangs of seperation. Violin rendition by A. Jayadevan', '2020-06-04 15:12:30', 1, '223.228.163.145', '2020-06-22 10:51:44', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
