(13, 'Ashtapadi (Guruvayoor Paani)', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Ashtapadi songs are part of Geeta Govindam, by Sanskrit poet Jayadeva. In the temples of Kerala, Ashtapadi is accompanied by the mellifluous beats of the Edakka. Hence it is also known as Sopana sangeetham (Music).', '<p>Ashtapadi songs are part of Geeta Govindam, the literary work by the 12th century Sanskrit poet Jayadeva. In the temples of Kerala, Ashtapadi is sung in front of the Sopanam, the flight of steps leading to the sanctum sanctorum, accompanied by the mellifluous beats of the Edakka. Hence it is also known as Sopana sangeetham (Music). It is sung only when the sanctum sanctorum door is closed for poojas. <br></p>', 'ashtapadi-guruvayoor-paani1.jpg', 'ashtapadi-guruvayoor-paani.jpg', 'ashtapadi-guruvayoor-paani.jpg', 'Ashtapadi (Guruvayoor Paani)', '2000-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'ashtapadi-guruvayoor-paani', 'Ashtapadi (Guruvayoor Paani) | Gita Govinda', 'ashtapadi, janardanan nedungadi, guruvayoor paani, ashtapadi 4 lyrics, jayadeva ashtapadi lyrics with meaning, gita govinda, jayadeva ashtapadi, jayadeva ashtapadi songs lyrics, jayadeva ashtapadi lyrics with meaning, ashtapadi gita govindam lyrics, ashtapadi in malayalam, ashtapathi (sopana sangeetham), lalitha lavanga ashtapadi, lalita labanga lata odia bhajan lyrics, Pralaya Payodhi Jale, Manjutara Kunjatala, Radha Vadana Vilokana, Stana Vinihitamapi', 'Ashtapadi songs are part of Geeta Govindam, by Sanskrit poet Jayadeva. In the temples of Kerala, Ashtapadi is accompanied by the mellifluous beats of the Edakka. Hence it is also known as Sopana sangeetham (Music).', '2020-06-11 07:53:37', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-19 11:24:04', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(14, 'Entwined', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'The confluence of five musical instruments violin, mridangam, ghatam, santhoor and tabla brings in the finest elements of both Carnatic and Hindustani music.', '<p>Entwined - a mesmerizing musical album from the violin maestro A. Jayadevan. The confluence of five musical instruments violin, mridangam, ghatam, santhoor and tabla brings in the finest elements of both Carnatic and Hindustani music. The album, with its five superb compositions, will surely lavish upon the listener the bliss of heavenly music.<br>Mrudangam: Neyveli B.Venkatesh<br>Tabla: Subhajyoti Guha<br>Santhoor: Sandip Chatterjee<br>Ghatam: Manjoor Unnikrishnan<br></p>', 'entwined.jpg', 'entwined-i.jpg', 'entwined-i.jpg', 'violin', '2013-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'entwined', 'Entwined, confluence of violin, mridangam, ghatam, santhoor and tabla', 'Entwined, entwined, album, musical, instrument, music, classical, carnatic, Hindustani, jayadevan, neyveli b venkatesh, subhajyoti guha, sandip chatterjee, manjoor unnikrishnan, violin, mridangam, ghatam, santhoor, tabla, fusion,violin cover, how to play on violin,  instrumental violin, violin recital, violin recital program, violin music, violin music ringtone, violin music mp3 download, beautiful violin music, violin music notes, violin music for beginners', 'The confluence of five musical instruments violin, mridangam, ghatam, santhoor and tabla brings in the finest elements of both Carnatic and Hindustani music.', '2020-06-11 08:26:23', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-08-07 09:41:21', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(15, 'Entwined II', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Enjoy the ecstasy of music with ‘Entwined,’ an enticing musical album,  fusion of five musical instruments, violin, mridangam, ghatam, santhoor and tabla', '<p>Enjoy the ecstasy of music with ‘Entwined,’ an enticing musical album from the violin maestro A. Jayadevan. The fusion of five musical instruments, violin, mridangam, ghatam, santhoor and tabla, brings in the finest elements of various schools of Indian music. The four fascinating compositions of ‘Entwined’ intimate the supreme aspects of music to the listeners.<br>Mrudangam: Neyveli B.Venkatesh<br>Tabla: Subhajyoti Guha<br>Santhoor: Sandip Chatterjee<br>Ghatam: Manjoor Unnikrishnan<br><br><br></p>', 'entwined-ii.jpg', 'entwined-ii.jpg', 'entwined-ii.jpg', 'violin', '2013-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'entwined-2', 'Entwined, an enticing album from the A. Jayadevan,  Neyveli B. Venkatesh, Subhajyoti Guha, Sandip Chatterjee and Manjoor Unnikrishnan', 'entwined, ablum ii, instrument, music, fusion, violin, mridangam, ghatam, santhoor, tabla, jayadevan, neyveli b venkatesh, subhajyoti guha, sandip chatterjee, manjoor unnikrishnan, carnatic, hindustani, classical,indian classical music, free classical music downloads, free download most popular classical music, classical music songs, classical music for studying, classical musical instrument,musical instrument, invis multimedia,', 'Enjoy the ecstasy of music with ‘Entwined,’ an enticing musical album,  fusion of five musical instruments, violin, mridangam, ghatam, santhoor and tabla', '2020-06-11 08:30:23', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-25 07:42:50', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-07-07 11:12:57', 1, '137.97.175.73', 2),
(16, 'Utsava Sampradaya Kritis', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'These songs composed by Saint Thyagaraja are simple, inspiring and spiritual. Here the musical perfection of the Utsava Sampradaya Krithis is captured on the enchanting notes of the Veena.', '<p>Utsava Sampradaya Kritis are songs written in association with Pooja Vidhi or the traditional rituals involved in worshipping. These songs composed by Saint Thyagaraja are simple, inspiring and spiritual. Veena is verily the most mesmerizing of the classical musical instruments in India. Here the musical perfection of the Utsava Sampradaya Krithis is captured on the enchanting notes of the Veena.<br></p><p>Musically, utsava sampradaya krithis can be divided into two kinds, Ekadhatu and Dwidhatu. In Ekadhatu the refrain (Pallavi) and the following stanzas (Charanam) have then the same tune. In Dwidhatu they are structured differently. All these songs have, generally, simplicity as the key-note enabling all the devotees present with little or no musical training to join in the chorus. Finally, these are songs that, help spread the joy not only of music but of serving and singing the praise of the Supreme Being<br></p>', 'utsava-sampradaya-kritis1.jpg', 'utsava-sampradaya-kritis.jpg', 'utsava-sampradaya-kritis.jpg', 'Veena', '2000-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'utsava-sampradaya-kritis', 'Utsava Sampradaya Kritis composed by Saint Thyagaraja', 'Utsava Sampradaya Kritis, veena recital, utsava samapradaya kritis, music, kerala, maya varma, artist, saint, thyagaraja, instrument, veena music mp3, veena sangeetham, veena music ringtone, \r\nveena musician, veena jugalbandi, \r\nindian classical music, free classical music downloads, free download most popular classical music, classical music songs, classical music for studying, classical musical instrument,musical instrument, invis multimedia,', 'These songs composed by Saint Thyagaraja are simple, inspiring and spiritual. Here the musical perfection of the Utsava Sampradaya Krithis is captured on the enchanting notes of the Veena.', '2020-06-11 08:37:57', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-26 11:43:26', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(17, 'Swatipadam', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Swatipadams are songs popular for lyrical beauty written by Swati Tirunal, the erstwhile ruler of the princely state of Travancore (Thiruvithancore). These songs features rare compositions by Swati Tirunal recited by Dr. Deepti Omchery Bhalla and Geeta Ranjendran in its original tune.', '<p>Swatipadams are songs popular for lyrical beauty written by Swati Tirunal Rama Varma (1813 –1847) an erstwhile ruler of the princely state of Travancore. He was a great composer who made significant contributions to music and dance. Swati Tirunal gave Mohiniyattam, the classical female dance-tradition of Kerala a new dimension through specially written padams (lyrics), which later became popular as Swatipadams.                                                                   <br>Vocal : Dr. Deepti Omchery Bhalla and Geeta Rajendran</p>', 'swatipadam.jpg', 'swatipadam.jpg', 'swatipadam.jpg', 'Swatipadam ', '2003-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'swatipadam', 'Swatipadam, Rare compositions of Swati Tirunal in their original tune', 'swatipadam, Swati Tirunal, padams, lyrics,  Dr. Deepti Omchery Bhalla, Geeta Rajendran, Deepti Bhalla, Raagam, Taalam, Thodi, Rupakam, swathi thirunal krithis lyrics, swathi thirunal compositions,  swathi thirunal keerthanam, swathi thirunal movie songs, swathi thirunal krithis in Malayalam,  malayalam classical songs, malayalam semi classical songs free download, Music, Music Album, Indian Music, Classical Music, Indian classical music,', 'Swatipadams are songs popular for lyrical beauty written by Swati Tirunal, the erstwhile ruler of the princely state of Travancore (Thiruvithancore). These songs features rare compositions by Swati Tirunal recited by Dr. Deepti Omchery Bhalla and Geeta Ranjendran in its original tune.', '2020-06-11 08:47:17', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-22 11:05:29', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(18, 'Kathakalippadam', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'These songs features Melappadam and songs from Kalyanasougandhikam. They are accompanied by percussion: Maddalam by Kalanilayam Babu and Chenda by Kalamandalam Krishnadas.', '<p>These songs features Melappadam and songs from Kalyanasougandhikam. They are accompanied by percussion: Maddalam by Kalanilayam Babu and Chenda by Kalamandalam Krishnadas.<br><br>Kathakalipadams are songs sung in the Sopanam style of music and are part of Kathakali performances, the classical dance form of Kerala. The stories taken up for Kathakali performances are conveyed through Kathakalipadams. The slow rhythmic pace with subtle variations in pitch is a noted feature of Kathakalipadam renditions<br><br></p>', 'kathakalippadam.jpg', 'kathakalippadam.jpg', 'kathakalippadam.jpg', 'Kathakalippadam ', '2008-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'kathakalippadam', 'Kathakalippadam - rendering Melappadam and songs from Kalyanasougandhikam', 'kathakalippadam, kalamandalam haridas, margi damu, Kathakali Song,Melappadam, Kalyanasougandhikam,Kalanilayam Babu,Kalamandalam Krishnadas,Sopanam style,Kathakali,kathakali singer', 'Kathakalippadam by Kalamandalam Haridas and Margi Damu rendering Melappadam and songs from Kalyanasougandhikam.', '2020-06-13 07:58:35', 1, '223.228.152.198', '2020-06-22 11:10:06', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(19, 'Oothukkadu Kritis', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Featuring recitals of Oothukkadu Kritis on Veena by Jayalakshmi Sekhar. Accompanying Jayalakshmi Sekhar is T. K. Ramakrishnan on the Mridangam and Trivandrum D. Rajagopal on the Ganjira. Listeners of this veena recital could easily embark on the sublimity of Oothukkadu Kritis.', '<p>Oothukkadu Kritis are unique Carnatic music compositions by Oothukkadu Venkata Kavi. In the galaxy of music, he will always find a place as a shining star. Venkata Kavi was a great personality, an innovator who contributed a lot to Carnatic music. A complete master of music in all senses of the term, he has total command over melody, rhythm and lyrics besides being fluent in Sanskrit and Tamil. He was proficient in a variety of musical forms such as kriti, javali, tillana and kavadi chindu.<br></p><p>Accompanying Jayalakshmi Sekhar is T. K. Ramakrishnan on the Mridangam and Trivandrum D. Rajagopal on the Ganjira, listeners of this veena recital could easily embark on the sublimity of Oothukkadu Kritis.<br></p>', 'oothukkadu-kritis.jpg', 'oothukkadu-kritis.jpg', 'oothukkadu-kritis.jpg', 'Veena', '2009-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'oothukkadu-kritis', 'Recitals of Oothukkadu Kritis on Veena by Jayalakshmi Sekha', 'oothukkadu kritis, carnatic music, veena, jayalakshmi sekhar, instrumental, veena music mp3, veena sangeetham, veena music ringtone, \r\nveena musician, veena jugalbandi, \r\nindian classical music, free classical music downloads, free download most popular classical music, classical music songs, classical music for studying, classical musical instrument,musical instrument, invis multimedia,', 'Featuring recitals of Oothukkadu Kritis on Veena by Jayalakshmi Sekhar. Accompanying Jayalakshmi Sekhar is T. K. Ramakrishnan on the Mridangam and Trivandrum D. Rajagopal on the Ganjira. Listeners of this veena recital could easily embark on the sublimity of Oothukkadu Kritis.', '2020-06-15 07:22:36', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-22 11:14:33', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(20, 'Thiruvathirappattukal', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Thiruvathirappattu is the song that accompanies Thiruvathira Kali. The songs sound like a flowing river – sometimes it moves swiftly; sometimes they hurtle down like waterfalls; sometimes they have docile movements and at times they are serene.', '<p>Thiruvathirappattu is sung during the occasion of Thiruvathira celebrated on the Thiruvathira asterism in the Malayalam month of Dhanu (December/January). Thiruvathirappattu is the song that accompanies Thiruvathirakali. In Thiruvathirakali, dancers execute graceful movements full of laasya around a lighted traditional wick lamp (nilavilakku). The dance follows a circular, pirouetting pattern accompanied by clapping and singing. The songs sound like a flowing river – sometimes it moves swiftly; sometimes they hurtle down like waterfalls; sometimes they have docile movements and at times they are serene.<br></p><p>Vocal:  Geeta Rajendran, Aruna Thampi, Suresh<br>Veena: Maya Varma<br>Violin:  Vrinda Varma<br>Edakka:  Satheesh Poduwal<br>Mridangam:  Muttara N.Rajendran<br></p>', 'thiruvathirappattukal.jpg', 'thiruvathirappattukal.jpg', 'thiruvathirappattukal.jpg', 'Thiruvathira', '2004-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'thiruvathirappattukal-thiruvathira-songs', 'Thiruvathirappattukal, are the songs that accompanies Thiruvathirakali', 'thiruvathirapattukal,  thiruvathira, songs, Thiruvathira Paattukal,Thiruvathira Songs,Thiruvathira dance,Thiruvathirakali,Thiruvathira,Thiruvathirappattu,Malayalam month,Dhanu,Laasya,wick lamp,nilavilakku,clapping and singing,thiruvathira nakshatra,thiruvathira star,thiruvathira songs free download,thiruvathira songs free mp3 download,thiruvathira songs lyrics Malayalam,thiruvathira video songs free download,?????????????????????', 'Thiruvathirappattu is the song that accompanies Thiruvathira Kali. The songs sound like a flowing river – sometimes it moves swiftly; sometimes they hurtle down like waterfalls; sometimes they have docile movements and at times they are serene.', '2020-06-15 07:27:58', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-22 11:16:10', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(21, 'Kathakalipadam', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Kathakalippadams are songs sung in the Sopanam style of music integral to performances of Kathakali.', '<p>Kathakalipadams are songs sung in the Sopanam style of music and plays a significant role during performances of Kathakali, the resplendent classical dance form of Kerala. The story of Kathakali is conveyed through Kathakalipadams. The slow rhythmic pace with subtle variations in pitch is the noted feature of Kathakalipadams.<br>Maddalam: Kalanilayam Babu<br>Chenda: Margi Krishnadas<br></p><p><br></p>', 'kathakalipadam.jpg', 'kathakalipadam.jpg', 'kathakalipadam.jpg', 'kathakalipadam', '2003-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'kathakalipadam', 'Kathakalippadams are songs sung in the Sopanam style of music', 'kathakalippadam, kottakal madhu, vengeri narayanan, kathakalippadam, kottakkal madhu,kathakali padam mp3 download, kathakali padam kacheri, karnasapatham kathakali lyrics, Mathangananam, Ajitha Hare, Yami Yami, Veera Virada, Jayikka Jayikka, Vandana Slokam, Kedaragoulam, Kuchelavritham, Sreeragam, Nalacharitham, Madhyamavathi, Vijanebata, Uttara Swayamvaram, Santhan Gopalam', 'Kathakalippadams are songs sung in the Sopanam style of music integral to performances of Kathakali. The slow rhythmic pace with subtle variations in pitch is the noted feature of Kathakalipadams.', '2020-06-15 07:32:48', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-19 12:18:59', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(22, 'Gita Govinda', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Gita Govinda, a rhyme of eternal love and supreme devotion was composed in the 12th century by the poet Jayadeva. The songs in it echo the eternal love of Lord  krishna and Radha.', '<p>Gita Govinda, rendered in Kerala Sopana Style by Vinod M. P accompanied in <i>Edakka </i>by Sivadasan Marar. Gita Govinda, a rhyme of eternal love and supreme devotion was composed in the twelfth century by the poet Jayadeva. The songs in Gita Govinda echo the eternal love of Lord Krishna and Radha, with resonances of supreme devotion to God. The poem presents in dramatic form the lovers\' attraction, estrangement, yearning, and final reconciliation.<br></p>', 'gita-govinda-vol-i.jpg', 'gita-govinda-vol-i.jpg', 'gita-govinda-vol-i.jpg', 'ashtapadi', '2009-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'gita-govinda', 'Gita Govinda rendered in Kerala Sopana Style by Vinod M. P accompanied in Edakka by Sivadasan Marar', 'gita govinda , vinod m.p,  kerala,  sopana style,  poet jayadeva, lord krishna, radha, love,ashtapadi,ashtapadi 4 lyrics, jayadeva ashtapadi lyrics with meaning, jayadeva ashtapadi, jayadeva ashtapadi songs lyrics, jayadeva ashtapadi lyrics with meaning, ashtapadi gita govindam lyrics, ashtapadi in malayalam, ashtapathi (sopana sangeetham), Stana Vinihitamapi Haramudaram, Nibhruti Nikunja, Shrita Kamala Kucha Mandala, Pralaya Payodhi Jale, Lalita Lavanga Lata, Chandana Charchitha Neela Kalebaravinod', 'Gita Govinda, a rhyme of eternal love and supreme devotion was composed in the12th century by the poet Jayadeva. The songs in it echo the eternal love of Lord  krishna and Radha.', '2020-06-15 10:39:03', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-07-07 14:09:32', 1, '137.97.186.78', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(23, 'Sagara The Sea', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Flute rendition by Dr. P. Padmesh. Plumbing the depths, plummeting in the blueness, wafting in the waves, the endless vitality of the sea stretches on even beyond the horizon.', '<p>Sagara - The Sea, has flute rendition by Dr P. Padmesh. plumbing the depths, plummeting in the blueness, wafting in the waves, the endless vitality of the sea stretches on even beyond the horizon. Forever shimmering, forever sublime, the sea connects us with eternity. Lulling us, carrying us across births and deaths to some immortal shore. <br></p>', 'sagara.jpg', 'sagara.jpg', 'sagara.jpg', 'flute', '2009-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sagara-the-sea', 'Flute rendition by Dr. P. Padmesh', 'sagara,  the sea, flute, recital, padmesh, Flute Recital,Flute Music,Padmesh,indian flute instrumental music free download,flute music indian,flute music audio,flute music - youtube,best flute music,relaxing music,flute music,Music ,flute types,flute for beginners,flute sound, free music,', 'Flute rendition by Dr. P. Padmesh. Plumbing the depths, plummeting in the blueness, wafting in the waves, the endless vitality of the sea stretches on even beyond the horizon.', '2020-06-15 11:09:02', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-25 08:26:31', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(24, 'Raganubhava (Jugalbandi)', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Ragnubhava is jugalbandi of two mighty strands of Indian Classical, Carnatic and Hindustani.', '<p>Raganubhava is jugalbandi of two mighty strands of Indian classical music, Carnatic and Hindustani. Rendered by renowned artiste’s Jayadevan on the Violin, Debajit Chakrabarty on the Sitar, Neyveli Venkitesh on the Mridangam and Subhajyoti Guha on the Tabala. In music, jugalbandi’s are duet which is either vocal or instrumental. Literally the word means ‘entwined twins”.<br></p>', 'raganubhava-vol-i.jpg', 'raganubhava-vol-i.jpg', 'raganubhava-vol-i.jpg', 'violin', '2010-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'raganubhava-jugalbandi', 'Raganubhava is jugalbandi of two mighty strands of Indian classical music, Carnatic and Hindustani', 'violin, sitar, instrumental, string instruments, carnatic music, hindustani, raganubhava, jugalbandi, jayadevan, debajit chakrabarty, Gopalaka Pahimam, Ragam, Thanam, Pallavi, free mp3 download, best free mp3 download sites, free playlist download mp3, mp3 album download, direct download mp3 songs, best mp3 song download, violin cover, how to play on violin,  instrumental violin, violin recital, violin recital program, violin music, violin music ringtone, violin music mp3 download, beautiful violin music, violin music notes, violin music for beginners', 'Raganubhava (Jugalbandhi), has jugalbandi recital by the artistes Jayadevan on the Violin and Debajit Chakrabarty on the Sitar.', '2020-06-15 11:14:26', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-07-06 18:02:49', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(25, 'Varshaa: Rain Melodies', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Varshaa (Rain Melodies) or the music of rain portrays the characteristic moods of Monsoon rains of Kerala. Monsoon rains herald the rejuvenation period for Kerala.', '<p>Varshaa (Rain Melodies) portrays the characteristic moods of Monsoon rains of Kerala. The monsoons transform the state of Kerala into a land of verdant beauty.  Locally known as <i>Edavapathi </i>or the heavy Southwest Monsoon and <i>Thulavarsham </i>or the Northeast Monsoon, these rainy seasons provide the much-needed nourishment to the land and its inhabitants.  The climate during the monsoon is relished by both animate and inanimate, some of which spring to life, while others get rejuvenated. In Kerala, the Monsoons cut the pace of life to a low gear, but life does not come to a halt. As the Monsoons dictate the rhythm of life, the people, as well as other life forms, become part of it. For some, the music that the rains bring is exciting and for those with a literary bent of mind, the climate perks up their creative thoughts. While some idle away in the all-prevailing cool ambience, children often indulge in fun-based activities in the water world. <br></p>', 'varshaa-rain-melodies.jpg', 'varshaa-rain-melodies.jpg', 'varshaa-rain-melodies.jpg', 'rain', '2007-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'varshaa-rain-melodies', 'Varshaa (Rain Melodies), the music captures the many moods of the rainy season.', 'Varshaa, Rain Melodies, Romancing the Rain,Varshaa,Rain Melodies,music of rain,Music of Fusion,Rain,Melodies,Jaison J. Nair,Edavapathi,Monsoon,Southwest Monsoon,Thulavarsham,Northeast Monsoon,moods of Monsoon rains of Kerala,rain music,relaxing rain and thunder sounds,rain music mp3,relaxing rain sounds for sleeping,rain falling sound effect,Music,Music Album,Indian Music', 'Varshaa (Rain Melodies) or the music of rain portrays the characteristic moods of Monsoon rains of Kerala. Monsoon rains herald the rejuvenation period for Kerala.', '2020-06-15 11:17:06', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-25 08:22:57', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(26, 'Swati Kritis', 0, 0, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Veena recital on Swati kritis, the jewels of compositions in the Carnatic music world, composed by Swathi Thirunal Rama Varma', '<p>Recitals of Swati Kritis on Veena by Jayalakshmi Sekhar. Accompanying Jayalakshmi Sekhar is T. K. Ramakrishnan on the Mridangam and Trivandrum D. Rajagopal on the Ganjira, listeners of this veena recital could easily enter into a sublime world of music especially of Swati Kritis. Swati Kritis are the jewels of compositions in the Carnatic music world. These Kritis are the compositions by Swathi Thirunal Rama Varma who was a patron of music. He was an ardent musician of both systems of Indian classical music, Hindustani and Carnatic. He is credited with composing over 400 songs in Carnatic music as well as Hindustani music. Some of his favourite compositions are Padmanabha Pahi, Deva Deva, Sarasijanabha and Sree Ramana Vibho.<br><br></p>', 'swati-kritis.jpg', 'swati-kritis.jpg', 'swati-kritis.jpg', 'veena', '2009-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'swati-kritis', 'Recitals of Swati Kritis on Veena by Jayalakshmi Sekhar', 'Swati Kritis, swati kritis, veena, jayalakshmi sekhar, swathi thirunal, carnatic music,  instrumental, Swathi Thirunal Rama Varma, veena musician, veena jugalbandi, \r\nindian classical music, free classical music downloads, free download most popular classical music, classical music songs, classical music for studying, classical musical instrument,musical instrument, invis multimedia, free mp3 download, best free mp3 download sites, free playlist download mp3, mp3 album download, direct download mp3 songs, best mp3 song download', 'Veena recital on Swati kritis, the jewels of compositions in the Carnatic music world, composed by Swathi Thirunal Rama Varma', '2020-06-16 05:59:07', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2026-05-19 10:56:51', 19, '49.37.224.200', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(27, 'Kalyanapattukal', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Kalyana Pattukal or songs for marriage,  are the songs associated with the functions of marriages.  The songs belonging to this genre had a vast repertoire,  the lyrics and singing style of which have been developed by lyricists and singers.', '<p>Kalyanapattukal is one of the old forms of music found in Kerala. These are the songs sung during various marriage ceremonies. Sometimes they are accompanied by dancers to enhance the spirit of women folk. <br><br>Research & Music:  Dr. Leela Omchery & Dr. Deepti Omchery Bhalla<br>Vocal:  Geeta Rajendran, Aruna Thampi<br>Veena:  Maya Varma<br>Violin:  Vrinda Varma<br>Edakka:  Satheesh Poduwal<br>Mridangam:  Muttara N. Rajendran<br></p>', 'kalyanapattukal.jpg', 'kalyanapattukal.jpg', 'kalyanapattukal.jpg', 'marriage', '2004-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'kalyanapattukal', 'Kalyanapattukal is one of the traditional folk music found in Kerala', 'Kalyanapattukal, knanaya songs lyrics in malayalam, kalyana pattukal lyrics, mappila pattukal, kalyana mappila song mp3 download, mappilapattu, marriage songs, malayalam wedding songs mp3 download, traditional wedding songs, dulhan wedding songs mp3 download, dance songs for wedding sangeet, indian wedding dance songs, Leela Omchery, Deepti Omchery Bhalla, free mp3 download, best free mp3 download sites, free playlist download mp3, mp3 album download, direct download mp3 songs, best mp3 song download', 'Kalyana Pattukal or songs for marriage,  are the songs associated with the functions of marriages.  The songs belonging to this genre had a vast repertoire,  the lyrics and singing style of which have been developed by lyricists and singers.', '2020-06-17 10:41:00', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-20 06:54:49', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(28, 'Swati Kaleena Kritis', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'These are songs popular for lyrical beauty written by Swati Tirunal Rama Varma (1813 –1847) an erstwhile ruler of the princely state of Travancore. He was a great composer who made significant contributions to music and dance.', '<p>These are songs popular for lyrical beauty written by Swati Tirunal Rama Varma (1813 –1847) an erstwhile ruler of the princely state of Travancore. He was a great composer who made significant contributions to music and dance.<br></p><p>Vocal:  Dr. Deepti Omchery Bhalla & Dr. Sreelekha Sivan<br>Veena:  Maya Varma<br>Violin:  Trivandrum Santhosh<br>Mridangam:  Trivandrum Raveendran<br>Edakka:  Unnikrishnan<br></p>', 'swati-kaleena-kritis.jpg', 'swati-kaleena-kritis.jpg', 'swati-kaleena-kritis.jpg', 'Swati', '2004-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'swati-kaleena-kritis', 'Swati Kaleena kritis, songs popular for lyrical beauty written by Swati Tirunal Rama Varma', 'Swati Kaleena kritis,Swati Tirunal,Dr. Deepti Omchery Bhalla,Deepti Bhalla,swathi thirunal krithis lyrics,swathi thirunal in malayalam,swathi thirunal compositions,swathi thirunal keerthanam,swathi thirunal movie songs,swathi thirunal krithis in Malayalam,malayalam classical songs,malayalam semi classical songs free download,Music,Music Album,Indian Music,Classical Music,free mp3 download, best free mp3 download sites, free playlist download mp3, mp3 album download, direct download mp3 songs, best mp3 song download', 'These are songs popular for lyrical beauty written by Swati Tirunal Rama Varma (1813 –1847) an erstwhile ruler of the princely state of Travancore. He was a great composer who made significant contributions to music and dance.', '2020-06-17 11:15:53', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-25 08:16:20', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(29, 'Gita Govinda Vol II', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Gita Govinda, a rhyme of eternal love and supreme devotion was composed in the twelfth  century by the poet Jayadeva. The songs in it echo the eternal Love of Lord  krishna and Radha', '<p>Gita Govinda, a rhyme of eternal love and supreme devotion was composed in the twelfth century by the poet Jayadeva. The songs in Gita Govinda echo the eternal love of Lord Krishna and Radha, with resonances of supreme devotion to God.<br></p>', 'gita-govinda-vol-ii.jpg', 'gita-govinda-vol-ii.jpg', 'gita-govinda-vol-ii.jpg', 'ashtapadi', '2009-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'gita-govinda-vol-2', 'Gita Govinda  in Kerala sopana style, the songs in it echo the eternal Love of Lord  krishna and Radha', 'gita govinda , Stana Vinihitamapi Haramudaram, Nibhruti Nikunja, Shrita Kamala Kucha Mandala, Pralaya Payodhi Jale, Lalita Lavanga Lata, Chandana Charchitha Neela Kalebaravinod m.p,  sopana style,  poet jayadeva, lord krishna, radha, love,ashtapadi,ashtapadi 4 lyrics, jayadeva ashtapadi lyrics with meaning, jayadeva ashtapadi, jayadeva ashtapadi songs lyrics, jayadeva ashtapadi lyrics with meaning, ashtapadi gita govindam lyrics, ashtapadi in malayalam, ashtapathi (sopana sangeetham), ', 'Gita Govinda, a rhyme of eternal love and supreme devotion was composed in the twelfth  century by the poet Jayadeva. The songs in it echo the eternal Love of Lord  krishna and Radha', '2020-06-17 12:26:09', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-25 07:33:21', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-07-07 11:13:13', 1, '137.97.175.73', 2),
(30, 'Raganubhava (Jugalbandi)  II', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', '', '<p>Raganubhava (Jugalbandi) Vol II, jugalbandi of two mighty strands of Indian classical music, Carnatic and Hindustani. Rendered by renowned artiste’s Jayadevan on the Violin, Debajit Chakrabarty on the Sitar, Neyveli Venkitesh on the Mridangam and Subhajyoti Guha on the Tabala.<br>In music jugalbandi’s are duet which is either vocal or instrumental. Literally the word means ‘entwined twins”.<br></p>', 'raganubhava-jugalbandi-ii.jpg', 'raganubhava-jugalbandi-ii.jpg', 'raganubhava-jugalbandi-ii.jpg', 'violin', '2010-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'raganubhava-jugalbandi-vol-ii', 'Raganubhava,  jugalbandi of instruments like violin and sitar', 'jugalbandi, carnatic music, hindustani, violin, sitar, classical, jayadevan, debajit chakrabarty, raganubhava, violin cover, how to play on violin,  instrumental violin, violin recital, violin recital program, violin music, violin music ringtone, violin music mp3 download, beautiful violin music, violin music notes, violin music for beginners, free mp3 download, best free mp3 download sites, free playlist download mp3, mp3 album download, direct download mp3 songs, best mp3 song download', 'Jugalbandhi of Violin and sitar – two important string instruments in carnatic and Hindustani classical music of India.', '2020-06-17 12:28:55', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-25 07:38:14', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-07-07 11:13:25', 1, '137.97.175.73', 2),
(31, 'Sadaram', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Sadaram is a Violin concert in Carnatic classical music by A. Jayadevan.', '<p>Sadaram is a violin concert in Carnatic classical music by A. Jayadevan. Jayadevan’s mastery of violin is well evident as he plays the Keerthanas composed by great musicians like Thyagaraja, Swathi Thirunal, Meerabai and contemporary masters like Dr. M. Balamuralikrishna and Papanasam Sivan. He is accompanied by Tiruvaarur Bakthavatsalam on mrudangam and Vaikom R. Gopalakrishnan on ghatam. <br></p>', 'sadaram.jpg', 'sadaram.jpg', 'sadaram.jpg', 'violin', '2007-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'sadaram', 'Sadaram: Carnatic Classical Recital on Violin', 'sadaram, violin, classical, carnatic classical music, karnatic, concert, recital, a. jayadevan, keerthana, keerthan, kirthan,  south, indian, canada, tiruvaarur bakthavatsalam, mrudangam, vaikom r. gopalakrishnan, ghatam, thyagaraja, dr. m. balamuralikrishna, swathithirunal,  papanasam sivan, meerabai, raghunayaka, kamaladalayatha, bandureethi, manasayedulo, pahijaga janani, ennathavam, payo payogi, abhayadev,free mp3 download, best free mp3 download sites, free playlist download mp3, mp3 album download, direct download mp3 songs, best mp3 song download', 'Sadaram is a violin concert in Carnatic classical music by A. Jayadevan. He is accompanied by Tiruvaarur Bakthavatsalam, on mrudangam and Vaikom R. Gopalakrishnan, on ghatam.', '2020-06-17 12:37:30', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-07-06 18:05:45', 6, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(32, 'Kaivalya: The Symphony of Meditation', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Kaivalya played on flute by Kudamaloor is the music of Nirvana – a state of sublime joy in supreme meditation.', '<p>Kaivalya - The Symphony of Meditation is a  flute rendition by Kudamaloor Janardanan. Kaivalya or the Symphony of Meditation charms the air through the swaras (musical notes) taking it to the innermost core of the soul and bringing tranquility to it.<br><br>Kaivalya is a creative endeavour on flute based on three melodious ragas, Nalinakanthi, Saraswathi and Sri, which will surely provide the mind with peace and energy. Sapthaswara, the seven musical notes and their combinations have the power to sway the human mind. Kaivalya played on flute by Kudamaloor is the music of Nirvana – a state of sublime joy in supreme meditation. A music that helps attain bliss in a moment of pure and simple union with the Eternal.<br></p>', 'kaivalya-the-symphony-of-meditation.jpg', 'kaivalya-the-symphony-of-meditation.jpg', 'kaivalya-the-symphony-of-meditation.jpg', 'kudamaloor', '2004-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'kaivalya-symphony-of-meditation', 'Kaivalya - The Symphony of Meditation , Flute Recital By Kudamaloor Janardanan', 'kaivalya, kudamaloor janardanan, flute, odakkuzhal, music,  flautist, wind instrument, meditation,Flute recital,Flute,Kudamaloor Janardhanan,flute recital by kudamaloor janardanan,flute recital mp3 free download,indian flute mp3 free download,classical flute mp3 free download,keli flute music,kudamaloor janardanan albums,flute concert mp3 download,kudamaloor janardanan keli,flute recital carnatic kudamaloor,Flute Music,flute music indian,flute music audio,best flute music,relaxing music,flute for beginners', 'Kaivalya,the symphony of meditation played on flute by Kudamaloor is the music of Nirvana – a state of sublime joy in supreme meditation.', '2020-06-17 12:43:51', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-20 10:47:36', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(33, 'Viraha: The Symphony of Separation', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Viraha, the sweet sorrow of separation immortalized in the love of Radha & Krishna is rendered poignantly on flute by Kudamaloor Janardanan.', '<p>Viraha (The Symphony of Separation), has flute  rendition by Kudamaloor Janardanan, conveying the pangs of separation. Even as inseparable minds separate, the ensuing agony is shared through Swaras and Ragas. Raga itself means love. Hearts that pine for reunion with the beloved, overflow with song, expressing the eternal bond of love. Three ragas namely Pushpalathika, Sarasang and Hemavathi have been used in the composition of Viraha.<br></p>', 'viraha-the-symphony-of-separation.jpg', 'viraha-the-symphony-of-separation.jpg', 'viraha-the-symphony-of-separation.jpg', 'kudamaloor', '2004-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'viraha-symphony-of-separation', 'Viraha - The Symphony of Separation, played on flute by Kudamaloor Janardanan.', 'Kudamaloor Janardanan, Viraha,Symphony of Separation,Flute,free mp3 download, best free mp3 download sites, free playlist download mp3, mp3 album download, direct download mp3 songs, best mp3 song download, Pushpalathika,Sarasang,Hemavathi,love of Radha and Krishna,Radha and Krishna,kudamaloor janardanan flute free download,kudamaloor janardanan albums,kudamaloor janardanan flute,kudamaloor janardanan madhava murali download,flute music of janardhanan free download,classical musical instrument,musical perfection,Music,Music Album,Indian Music,Music concert,Indian classical music', 'Viraha, the sweet sorrow of separation immortalized in the love of Radha & Krishna is rendered poignantly on flute by Kudamaloor Janardanan.', '2020-06-20 08:13:53', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-20 11:13:55', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(34, 'Keli : The Symphony of Love', 0, NULL, 'f', 'y', 'y', 'Keli - The Symphony of Love, played on flute by Kudamaloor Janardanan. Keli is a musical tribute to love – the most joyful, enchanting and universal aspect of human life.', '<p>Keli has flute rendition by Kudamaloor Janardanan. Keli is a musical tribute to love – the most joyful, enchanting and universal aspect of human life. To the listeners, Keli has for them flute recitals that brings out the best of Raga Syama while it attempts to capture a moment of ecstatic union, Madhyamavathy raga depicting loves sweet consummation as in the case of Lord Krishna and Radha and Ragamalika Raga epitomizing Lord Krishna as the ideal lover. He captivates his audience with a composition on the theme Keli which is a soul lilting music of love on flute.<br><br>Love – the most unrivalled of all human emotions, captivates poets, singers and lovers in all ages and places. Ever fresh and charming, love is like music, the more one experiences it, the more the pleasure. Knowing no satiety, it increases in intensity with time, each pang tasting more delicious than the previous.<br></p>', 'keli-the-symphony-of-love.jpg', 'keli-the-symphony-of-love.jpg', 'keli-the-symphony-of-love.jpg', 'kudamaloor', '2004-01-01', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'keli-symphony-of-love', 'Keli - The Symphony of Love, Flute recital by Kudamaloor Janardanan', 'Keli flute music, Flute recital by Kudamaloor Janardhanan, Flute recital,Flute,Kudamaloor Janardhanan,Keli,free mp3 download, best free mp3 download sites, free playlist download mp3, mp3 album download, direct download mp3 songs, best mp3 song download, symphony of love,Krishna and Radha,flute recital mp3 free download,indian flute mp3 free download,classical flute mp3 free download,keli flute music,kudamaloor janardanan albums,kudamaloor janardanan keli,flute recital carnatic kudamaloor,Flute Music,flute music indian,flute music audio,best flute music,relaxing music,flute for beginners,', 'Keli - The Symphony of Love, played on flute by Kudamaloor Janardanan. Keli is a musical tribute to love – the most joyful, enchanting and universal aspect of human life.', '2020-06-20 08:14:24', 1, '202.88.244.195', '2020-06-20 11:24:19', 1, '202.88.244.195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1);
