(26, 29, 1, 1267, 5, 'She is an excellent teacher.clearly explains wordmeaning and mudras.Her grip on talas and teaching it to students is really good.She is such a maestro  in abhinaya. Great opportunity for Bharatanatyam students to learn from  her.', '2020-05-21 16:21:39', 'a', 1, '176.205.40.79', '2020-06-09 10:23:14', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(27, 9, 1, 256, 5, 'This is a beautiful piece! I\'ve been learning dance for a while now, and my steps have improved but my abhinaya needs work. So I did find the class a little challenging, but that\'s all me. Highly recommend this class! I\'ve been a long time fan, and as a student based in the UK, I always seemed to miss her workshops. I can\'t explain how lucky I feel to live in this day and age where technology makes so much possible. I have arthritis which means I can\'t travel to my own teacher for class, and your site is helping me stay hopeful and keep training. Thank you! ', '2020-05-21 16:42:22', 'a', 1, '86.11.151.11', '2020-06-09 10:22:50', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL, NULL),
