(95, 1, 5, 1547, 5, 'Love Love Love this diary! It has served me well all through 2021 and I cannot wait for the release of the 2022 version!\n\nWhy I love it:\n\n-Quality paper that is a classy cream color with dark brown lines (not faded or light lines)\n-Coil binding is sturdy and doesn\'t get bent (even though I have put this notebook in my tote back with heavy books, laptop etc\n-The Monthly divider pages featuring top artists is inspiring!\n-This is the perfect book for various notes for dance, life, and day to day organization.', '2022-01-18 17:16:19', 'p', 1, '72.203.224.67', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
