(130, 171, 1, 5068, 5, 'Deepthi ma’am has shared such a beautiful and unique choreography with excellent explanations alongside giving learners the freedom at multiple points to play with our own imaginations and options. I am truly enjoying learning this creative in the Sopana style. Thank you!!', '2023-07-20 10:39:44', 'p', 1, '124.177.218.99', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
