(32, 4, 0, 'Om Jayanti Mangala Kali by Yana Sharma', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jzyfAPlwVQ8', 'We are truly blessed to see such aspiring young talents chasing their passion!\r\nThank you, Yana, for this beautiful rendition of ‘Mangala Kali’ composition by Guru Pali Chandra.', '1-19032021053548.jpg', NULL, 0, 'om-jayanti-mangala-kali-by-yana-sharma', 'Om Jayanti Mangala Kali by Yana Sharma', 'Om Jayanti Mangala Kali, Kathak', 'We are truly blessed to see such aspiring young talents chasing their passion!\r\nThank you, Yana, for this beautiful rendition of ‘Mangala Kali’ composition by Guru Pali Chandra.', 0, '2021-03-19 05:35:48', '61.2.215.254', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
