(41, 4, 0, 'Sita\'s Voice by Madhuja Mukhopadhyay', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xKDeTVifVWs', 'Extremely glad to present a Bharatanatyam performance by Madhuja Mukhopadhyay.\r\nThank you Madhuja for being an enthusiastic participant in our year long journey!', '1-20032021095531.jpg', NULL, 0, 'sitas-voice-by-madhuja-mukhopadhyay', 'Sita\'s Voice by Madhuja Mukhopadhyay', 'Sita\'s Voice, Bharatanatyam', 'Extremely glad to present a Bharatanatyam performance by Madhuja Mukhopadhyay.\r\nThank you Madhuja for being an enthusiastic participant in our year long journey!', 0, '2021-03-20 09:55:31', '61.2.215.254', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(42, 1, 0, 'A Journey in Nritya', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hMhZhuX_ytc', 'In this video, Guru Pali Chandra celebrates International Dance Day 2021 by sharing her own unique bond with Nritya. The art form chose her at a young age, and she believes this organic process has introduced the whole world to her mesmerizing talent. Dance is a symphony between the artisan and their expressions, and every single movement is a message from the performer\'s soul. Every year, we celebrate International Dance Day on the 29th of April to commemorate this great relationship. Dance recreates and redefines culture for the masses, preserving our ancestors\' tales for our everyday consumption. It is this heritage that we at NatyaSutraOnline have sworn to protect and disseminate to the entire planet.   ', '', NULL, 2, 'dance-is-life-guru-pali-chandra', 'A Journey in Nritya with Guru Pali Chandra , Famous Classical Dancers of India', 'dance day 2021,international dance day 2021,indian classical dance,kathak,guru pali chandra,learn kathak online,world dance day,indian dance day,international dance,Kathak Dance,kathak choreographer,Lucknow Gharana Kathak,Who is the famous Kathak dancer,famous female kathak dancers,Lucknow gharana kathak dancers,famous kathak dancers of jaipur gharana,banaras gharana kathak dancers,famous classical dancers of india,famous kathak guru', 'In this video, Guru Pali Chandra, Famous Classical Dancers of India, celebrates International / World Dance Day by sharing her own unique bond with Nritya.', 0, '2021-04-28 07:52:45', '202.88.244.195', 0, '2021-04-28 08:03:43', '202.88.244.195', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(43, 5, 0, 'International Dance Day', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=puIkSBP0PZ4', 'As the World ushers in International Dance Day 2020, we at Natyasutraonline join hands with nritya lovers around the world. Dance transcends geographical and linguistic barriers and elevates the human mind and body to a separate dimension. We celebrate this divine ecstasy at Natyasutraonline, the new home for Indian classical dance. With teachers presenting classes and productions covering a plethora of native Indian dance forms, we usher in World Dance Day 2020 with open arms.', '', 'n', 20, 'international-dance-day', 'International Dance Day | World Dance Day | Classical Dances of India', 'International Dance Day,  World Dance Day, Classical Dances of India,', 'As the World ushers in International Dance Day 2020, we at Natyasutraonline join hands with nritya lovers around the world. With teachers presenting classes and productions covering a plethora of native Indian dance forms, we usher in World Dance Day 2020 with open arms.', 1, '2021-05-01 08:48:12', '116.68.79.36', 0, '2021-05-01 09:15:10', '116.68.79.36', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(44, 5, 0, 'Signature Video', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Odczmewkgcc', 'NatyaSutraOnline brings Indian cultural dance to the World. Thousands of years of our dance heritage are now available for the entire planet to consume. We aim at permanently preserving and reintroducing our Nritya to a whole new generation of enthusiasts.', '', NULL, 22, 'signature-video', 'NatyaSutraOnline Signature Video', 'NatyaSutraOnline, Signature Video', 'Signature Video of  NatyaSutraOnline', 0, '2021-05-01 08:53:53', '116.68.79.36', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(45, 5, 0, 'Happy Diwali Wishes', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=unKUbYxw_mc', 'natyasutraonline.com wishes you a very happy and joyful Diwali. \r\nPopularly known as the \"festival of lights\", Diwali is one of the major festivals of India.', '', NULL, 9, 'happy-diwali-wishes', 'Celebrate Diwali With NatyaSutraOnline | Happy Diwali Wishes From Team Invis', 'Happy Diwali Wishes , Celebrate Diwali, NatyaSutraOnline , Team Invis', 'natyasutraonline.com wishes you a very happy and joyful Diwali. \r\nPopularly known as the \"festival of lights\", Diwali is one of the major festivals of India.', 0, '2021-05-01 09:06:29', '116.68.79.36', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(46, 5, 0, 'A Stop Motion Floral Carpet', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=udZEWRPI5wA', 'Team NatyaSutraOnline wishes you and your loved ones a safe and blessed Onam. This 2020, we welcome King Mahabali amidst us with an exceptional floral carpet or athapookkalam. This stop motion Onam greeting is our unique offering to the entire dance community, as it encompasses the creativity and vision that inspires us regularly. As the world copes with an ever-evolving normal, let us use this festive period to channel our love for Indian classical art forms. As the digital home for all traditional art forms, Team NatyaSutraOnline once again wishes you a peaceful and prosperous Onam.', '', NULL, 10, 'stop-motion-floral-carpet', 'Onam Greetings | A Stop Motion Floral Carpet', 'Onam Greetings, Stop Motion, Floral Carpet, Onam', 'This stop motion Onam greeting is our unique offering to the entire dance community, as it encompasses the creativity and vision that inspires us regularly. As the digital home for all traditional art forms, Team NatyaSutraOnline once again wishes you a peaceful and prosperous Onam.', 0, '2021-05-01 09:09:53', '116.68.79.36', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(47, 5, 0, 'Merry Christmas', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MdI1h_TScwY', 'Guru Pali Chandra and the team NatyaSutraOnline wishes everyone a Merry Christmas and season filled with joy, peace and happiness. ', '', NULL, 8, 'christmas-greetings', 'Merry Christmas | Christmas Greetings from Guru Pali Chandra', 'Christmas Greetings,  Merry Christmas', 'Guru Pali Chandra and the team NatyaSutraOnline wishes everyone a Merry Christmas and season filled with joy, peace and happiness.', 0, '2021-05-01 09:12:19', '116.68.79.36', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(48, 12, 0, 'Teachers Day Wishes', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2KRxJF8fJCE', 'This video pays homage to the teachers who guide us in our journey in dance. Kathakali maestro  Sri Mudakkal Gopinathan Nair reminisces on the various ways in which his Guru Thakazhi Kuttan Pillai molded him.  Today, he honors the Guru who went above and beyond his responsibilities as a teacher by shaping his students\' moral and ethical viewpoints. Educators and instructors are the foremost protectors of our nation\'s cultural heritage and deserve our utmost respect. On Teachers Day 2021, NatyaSutraOnline pays tribute to all Guru\'s who forward the cause of Indian Classical Dance.      ', '', NULL, 3, 'teachers-day-wishes', 'Teachers Day Wishes | athakali Singer Mudakkal Gopinathan Nair recalls his Guru Thakazhi Kuttan Pill', 'teachers day,kathakali Music, Mudakkal Gopinathan Nair,Kathakali Acharyan,kathakali,teachers\' day 2021,teachers\' day in india,kathakali Sangeetha Acharyan,kathakali dance,famous kathakali artists in kerala,kathakali sangeetham,kathakali padam,kathakali sangeetham in malayalam,teachers day quotes,when is teachers\' day in india,when is teachers day in india 2021,when is teachers day', 'Kathakali Singer Mudakkal Gopinathan Nair recalls his Guru Thakazhi Kuttan Pillai', 0, '2021-09-04 10:32:39', '202.88.244.195', 0, '2025-07-10 06:47:23', '49.37.226.46', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(49, 6, 0, 'Ardhanareeswara Ashtakam Performance by Varun Khanna', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k32KPi27blo', 'Celebrating the dual nature of life!\r\nHere is Varun Khanna, participating in our 2nd Danciversary Celebrations by performing Ardhanareeswara Ashtakam, Bharatanatyam composition by  Smt. Rama Vaidyanathan. \r\n\r\nThank you for being part of our journey! \r\n\r\nTo learn this composition, visit: https://bit.ly/RArdhanareeswara\r\n', '1-20112021155052.jpg', NULL, 2, 'ardhanareeswara_ashtakam_performance_varun_khanna', 'Ardhanareeswara Ashtakam Performance by Varun Khanna', 'Anniversary videos, performance videos, dance sessions, online celebration, bharatanatyam, indian classical dance, elearning dance, learn bharatanatyam online, rama vaidyanathan, ardhanareeswara ashtakam', 'Bharatanatyam composition Ardhanareeswara Ashtakam Performance by Varun Khanna for Natyasutraonline\'s second danciversary virtual celebrations', 0, '2021-11-20 15:50:53', '103.155.222.172', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(50, 6, 0, 'Guru Vandana, Kathak Performance by Sadhna', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=32dGBm2WI9k', 'Reverence for teacher!\r\nThank you, Sadhna for participating in our virtual danciversary celebrations by dedicating your performance to the Guru! Our hearty wishes on your Kathak journey ????\r\n\r\nFor Kathak Beginners Lessons, visit: https://bit.ly/KBeginners\r\n', '1-20112021155844.jpg', NULL, 3, 'guru_vandana_-kathak_performance_sadhna', 'Guru Vandana, Kathak Performance by Sadhna', 'Guru Vandana, Kathak Performance, Anniversary videos, performance videos, dance sessions, online celebration, learn kathak online, pali chandra, kathak classes, online kathak, kathak tutorials', 'Guru Vandana, Kathak Performance by Sadhna for Natyasutraonline\'s second danciversary virtual celebrations', 0, '2021-11-20 15:58:44', '103.155.222.172', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(51, 6, 0, 'Guru Vandana, Kathak Performance by Sundari', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2oEC6U69t4Q', 'Pranam to Guru!\r\n\r\nWatch a delightful performance from Sundari, showcased as part of our 2nd danciversary celebrations. We hope you achieve greater heights with all your zeal and enthusiasm. \r\n\r\nFew words from Sundari:\r\n\"I am part of the learner team of Guruji Pali Chandra’s Learn Kathak Online. Being an interior designer, homemaker, I was finding it difficult to attend classes in a specific time frame, the Natyasutraonline was a boon to me as I can learn my favorite dance form at my own pace and place at my convenience.  I can proudly say that I am 37 years old and I am dancing after 18 years of my break. Guru Palichandra Ji, you have been a truly inspirational and influencer for me in my life. As you always mention in your video, I am happily dancing\"\r\n\r\nKathak Beginners Lessons: https://bit.ly/KBeginners', '1-20112021160308.jpg', NULL, 4, 'guru_vandana_kathak_performance_sundari', 'Guru Vandana, Kathak Performance by Sundari', 'Anniversary videos, performance videos, dance sessions, online celebration, kathak, indian classical dance, elearning dance, learn kathak online, pali chandra', 'Guru Vandana, Kathak Performance by Sundari for Natyasutraonline\'s second danciversary virtual celebrations', 0, '2021-11-20 16:03:08', '103.155.222.172', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(52, 5, 0, 'Keep your Dreams Alive Through Natyasutra', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mEG0-49Ypws', 'This video shows that it is never too late to follow your \"dance-dreams\". There may be many social, cultural and economic barriers that obstruct your deepest desires. But in this digital age, permit Natyasutra to fulfill your passion. Let our impressive collection of tutorials from maestros guide you on the timeless path of nritya. Don\'t allow orthodox fears or age bias dampen your spirits. Let Natyasutra be your wings, and lead you towards a journey of joy and wonder.   ', '', NULL, 5, 'learn-dance-at-anytime', 'Another Chance at Dance | Keep your Dreams Alive Through Natyasutra', 'Learn dance at anytime, Another Chance at Dance', 'This video shows that it is never too late to follow your \"dance-dreams\". There may be many social, cultural and economic barriers that obstruct your deepest desires.', 0, '2022-01-03 10:13:41', '223.178.117.136', 0, '2022-10-13 11:51:03', '171.49.217.187', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(53, 5, 0, 'Emotional Story From a True Warrior', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLKd8VyA-cM&t=26s', 'In this video, we visit a dancer’s battle with cancer. This is Smisha Arun, a dancer, choreographer, and theatre artist diagnosed with cancer at 33. Like anybody else, she, too, was initially terrified with the diagnosis. However, she decided to fight the disease and live life on her own terms. Despite the tremendous pain the disease caused, along with the bouts of depression, social and financial issues, she never gave in. Her grit and determination to defeat the disease have helped her to be a cancer survivor. \r\n\r\nShe is indeed a woman of substance, and her advice to us is to stay positive and discover all our possibilities even in adverse situations. On this occasion of National Cancer Awareness Day, NatyaSutra is proud to partner with an artist of such incredible grit and perseverance.\r\n\r\n#CancerAwareness #NationalCancerAwarenessDay #cancersurvivor #wecanican #standuptocancer #November7   ', '1-04012022073900.jpg', NULL, 6, 'steps-of-resilience-interview-with-smisha-arun', 'A Dancer\'s Clash with Cancer | Emotional Story From a True Warrior | National Cancer Awareness Day', 'dancers fight against cancer, stand up to cancer, cancer awareness, cancer awareness day, cancer awareness day 2021,talk with smisha arun, dancers journey, fight against cancer, National Cancer Awareness Day, national cancer awareness day theme, national cancer awareness day india, national cancer awareness day quotes, national cancer awareness day november 7,Cancer Awareness message,cancer awareness points, why cancer awareness is important, breast cancer awareness day', 'we visit a dancer’s battle with cancer. This is Smisha Arun, a dancer, choreographer, and theatre artist diagnosed with cancer at 33. Like anybody else, she, too, was initially terrified with the diagnosis. However, she decided to fight the disease and live life on her own terms. Despite the tremendous pain the disease caused, along with the bouts of depression, social and financial issues, she never gave in. Her grit and determination to defeat the disease have helped her to be a cancer survivor.', 0, '2022-01-04 07:39:00', '202.88.244.195', 0, '2022-10-13 11:50:15', '171.49.217.187', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(54, 7, 0, 'Ardhanareeswara Ashtakam, Bharatanatyam Performance by Varun Khanna | 2nd Danciversary Celebrations', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k32KPi27blo', NULL, '', 'n', 0, 'varun-khanna-ardhanareeshwara-ashtakam', 'Ardhanareeswara Ashtakam, Bharatanatyam Performance by Varun Khanna | 2nd Danciversary Celebrations', 'ardhanareeswara ashtakam,bharatanatyam, learn bharatanatyam,Danciversary celebration,rama vaidyanathan,2nd dance anniversary, Natyasutraonline, dance anniversary, bharatanatyam compositions, learn bharatanatyam from rama vaidyanathan, learn bharatanatyam,learn bharatanatyam online, bharatanatyam classical dance, ardhanareeswara stotram', 'Celebrating the dual nature of life!\r\nHere is Varun Khanna, participating in our 2nd Danciversary Celebrations by performing Ardhanareeswara Ashtakam, Bharatanatyam composition by  Smt. Rama Vaidyanathan. \r\n\r\nThank you for being part of our journey! ', 13, '2022-01-04 11:04:32', '202.88.244.195', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(55, 6, 0, 'Thanks a ton, fam!   Thank you for all the overwhelming support and friendship', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h5dtJyg4j9E', 'November 1st, we celebrate the 2nd edition of NatyaSutraOnline\'s inception. \r\nThis event is a yearly reminder that our amazing global dance community has propelled NatyaSutra to greater heights. The new courses, art forms, and maestros under the NatyaSutra umbrella are testament to this support.   ', '', NULL, 1, 'thanks-a-ton-fam', 'Thanks a ton, fam! | Thank you for all the overwhelming support and friendship |Our 2nd Danciversary', 'Anniversary videos, performance videos, dance sessions, online celebrations, dance videos, tutorials, Kathak dance, kathak, bharathanatyam, natyasutra, natyasutraonline,  kavit,', 'November 1st, we celebrate the 2nd edition of NatyaSutraOnline\'s inception. \r\nThis event is a yearly reminder that our amazing global dance community has propelled NatyaSutra to greater heights. The new courses, art forms, and maestros under the NatyaSutra umbrella are testament to this support.', 0, '2022-01-05 05:18:30', '202.88.244.195', 0, '2023-06-03 08:50:18', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(56, 6, 0, 'Yeppadi Manam\' | Sita\'s Voice, Bharatanatyam Performance by Janani', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CKCNTNL1Nbc', 'Thank you, Janani, for such a graceful performance on Sita\'s voice, Bharatanatyam composition by Smt. Rama Vaidyanathan. \r\n\r\nFor Compositions by Guru Rama Vaidyanathan, visit: https://bit.ly/RamaVaidyanathan    ', '', NULL, 5, 'janani-sitas-voice-bharatanatyam-mp4', 'Yeppadi Manam | Sita\'s Voice, Bharatanatyam Performance by Janani | 2nd Danciversary Celebrations', 'sita\'s voice, yeppadi manam tunidhadho, bharatanatyam performance, rama vaidyanathan, student performance, natyasutra dance anniversary, bharatanatyam, natyasutraonline, bharatanatyam dance,', 'Bharatanatyam Performance by Janani .\'Yeppadi Manam\' ,Sita\'s Voice,Bharatanatyam composition by Smt. Rama Vaidyanathan.', 0, '2022-01-05 05:43:09', '202.88.244.195', 0, '2023-06-03 07:04:13', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(57, 6, 0, 'Kavit Performance by Sheetal | Poetic Compositions in Kathak', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6jGA7NBgqYo', 'Thank you, Sheetal for participating in our second dance anniversary by performing Kavit. \r\nIt is always special for us to provide the platform for such young talents!\r\n\r\nKathak Beginners Lessons: https://bit.ly/KBeginners   ', '', NULL, 6, 'sheetal-kavit-kathak-mp4', 'Kavit Performance by Sheetal | Poetic Compositions in Kathak | NatyaSutraOnline Dance Anniversary', 'kavit,kathak kavit, kavit in english, kavit meaning, kathak kavit lyrics, kavit performance by sheetal, kathak student performance, kavit in hindi, kavit performance, learn kathak online, natyasutra dance anniversary, dance performance, kathak class', 'Sheetal for participating in natyasutraonline second dance anniversary by performing Kavit.', 0, '2022-01-05 05:53:36', '202.88.244.195', 0, '2023-06-03 07:12:01', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
