(65, 8, 0, 'Tatkaar (Footwork) by Guru Pali Chandra', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kL_m-AnoC74', 'Watch Guru Pali Chandra and her students give us a perfect demonstration of Tatkaar (Footwork) – in Teental.  These videos are excerpts from a professionally designed Online Kathak Learning program with paid subscription options.       \r\n\r\nFor Kathak Lessons by Guru Pali Chandra, visit: https://bit.ly/KBeginners\r\n      ', '1-28082025101140.jpg', 'n', 12, 'tatkaar-footwork-by-guru-pali-chandra', 'Tatkaar (Footwork) by Guru Pali Chandra', 'Tatkaar, Footwork, Guru Pali Chandra', 'Tatkaar (Footwork) Teental - Ekgun, Dugun and Chaugun | Basic Kathak Dance Steps', 1, '2022-10-11 12:09:43', '171.49.217.187', 0, '2025-08-28 10:11:40', '49.37.235.164', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(66, 8, 0, 'Rajasthani Folk Music', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y1NqYE6ktIs', ' https://www.natyasutraonline.com/music\r\n\r\nMost of the Rajasthani folk dances are accompanied by instruments, namely, Dholak, Kadthal, Nagara and Morchang. Dholak, Nagara and Kadthal are percussion instruments, while Morching is a string instrument. Jugalbandhi is a musical ensemble in which all the aforementioned instruments are played together. Jugalbandhi is usually performed during Rajasthani wedding ceremonies and other auspicious occasions.  ', '', 'n', 11, 'rajasthani-folk-music', 'Rajasthani Jugalbandhi ( Musical Ensemble ) | Rajasthani Folk Music', 'Rajasthani Folk Music', 'Rajasthani Jugalbandhi ( Musical Ensemble ) | Rajasthani Folk Music', 1, '2022-10-11 12:09:43', '171.49.217.187', 0, '2022-10-11 16:27:07', '49.37.225.94', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(67, 8, 0, 'अंग - अंग का सही उपयोग', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nXlvBpqCgws', 'For more www.natyasutraonline.com/kathak/gurupalichandra/beginners-lessons-hindi-learn-online\r\n\r\nकथक नृत्य में शरीर का सही संतुलन बनाये रखना उसका सौन्दर्य बढ़ना और अपने आप को किसी भी चोट से बचाकर अपने इस नृत्य का खूबसूरत अनुभव बनाये रखना, इन सभी बातों पर चर्चा करेंगी गुरु पाली चन्द्रा ।\r\n\r\nयहाँ सभी वीडियो विशेषग्गियों एवं पेशेवरों द्वारा रचित है जिसमें वैतनिक सदस्यता की सुविधा उपलब्ध है। पूर्ण सबक प्राप्त करने केलिए www.learnkathakonline.com/hindi पर लॉग इन करें।        ', '1-07062023061214.jpg', NULL, 9, 'correct-body-posture', 'अंग - अंग का सही उपयोग | Correct Body Posture| Learn Kathak Online', 'अंग - अंग का सही उपयोग , Kathak in Hindi,  Correct Body Posture, Learn Kathak Online', 'अंग - अंग का सही उपयोग  | Correct Body Posture| Learn Kathak Online', 0, '2022-10-11 16:38:35', '49.37.225.94', 0, '2023-06-07 06:12:14', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(68, 8, 0, 'Surya Namaskar by Isha Sharvani', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l1C0rD_DlUE', 'Surya Namaskar is also known as the sun salutation pose, is a warm up or toning exercise and is considered the best of all yoga exercises. Surya Namaskar is a series of twelve physical postures which help improve strength and flexibility of the muscle. Surya Namaskar posture also warms up the body and tones the abdominal muscles.\r\n\r\nYoga Demonstration by:  Isha Sharvani\r\n\r\nNote: – Supervision of an Experienced Yoga instructor is highly recommended for learning Yoga.   ', '', NULL, 10, 'suryanamaskar-by-isha-sharvani', 'Suryanamaskar, Yoga by Isha Sharvani, Indian Contemporary dancer and actress', 'Surya namaskar, Suryanamaskar, Yoga, The Sun Salutation, Isha Sharvani, yoga asana', 'Surya Namaskar (The Sun Salutation) | Yoga Demonstration by:  Isha Sharvani, Indian Contemporary dancer and actress', 0, '2022-10-12 04:52:58', '171.49.217.187', 0, '2025-11-19 11:59:56', '49.37.232.170', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(69, 8, 0, 'Flute recital by Kudamaloor Janardhanan', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NNkrOJ5fqXI', 'Flute recital by Kudamaloor Janardhanan that depicting love’s sweet consummation as in the case of Lord Krishna and Radha\r\nListen to complete audio here https://bit.ly/KeliNSO            ', '1-16112022050430.jpg', NULL, 13, 'flute-recital-kudamaloor-janardhanan', 'Flute recital by Kudamaloor Janardhanan - Keli, The symphony of love', 'Flute recital, Kudamaloor Janardhanan, Lord Krishna and Radha, symphony of love', 'Flute recital by Kudamaloor Janardhanan that depicting love’s sweet consummation as in the case of Lord Krishna and Radha', 0, '2022-10-12 04:56:01', '171.49.217.187', 0, '2022-11-16 05:08:05', '49.37.232.164', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(70, 8, 0, 'Vajrasana', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=82p0aGNJSF4', 'Vajrasana, also known as  the diamond pose, is a sitting posture which involves sitting on the knees with the calves beneath the thighs. It is the only pose that can be done on a full stomach.\r\n\r\nThe pose is ideal for practicing meditation and breathing exercises like Pranayama, Kapalabhati, and Anulom Vilom. \r\n\r\nVajrasana makes joints and ligaments strong as well as flexible. The muscles around the pelvic regions are greatly benefited. The posture also stimulates the functioning of kidneys, liver and pancreas.\r\n\r\nYoga Demonstration by:  Gayatri Srinivasan\r\n\r\nNote: – Supervision of an Experienced Yoga instructor is highly recommended for learning Yoga.', '', NULL, 14, 'vajrasana-sitting-yoga-posture', 'Vajrasana / the thunderbolt / the diamond pose / the sitting asana in Yoga', 'Vajrasana, thunderbolt,  diamond pose , sitting asana in Yoga, yogasana, yoga, yoga asana, ypga postture', 'Vajrasana,is a sitting posture which makes joints and ligaments strong as well as flexible. The posture also stimulates the functioning of kidneys, liver and pancreas.', 0, '2022-10-12 05:00:13', '171.49.217.187', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(71, 8, 0, 'Odissi Mangalacharan', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1wX5yHh6DHc', 'This marks the entrance of the dancer on stage in the Odissi style. The dancer invokes the blessings of Lord Jagannath for an auspicious beginning. Then the dancer offers salutation to the Mother Earth, the Teacher, and the Accompanist and to the Audience. Then follows a prayer to Lord Ganesh, remover of all obstacles.\r\n  \r\nRaaga: Megh & Kedar                \r\nTaala: Chaturasra Ekatali\r\nChoreography- Guru Kelucharan Mohapatra\r\nMusic- Pandit Bhubaneswar Mishra\r\n\r\nLearn Odissi Online from Sujata Mohapatra: Visit https://www.natyasutraonline.com/odissi/sujata-mohapatra-kelucharan/beginners-fundamental-video-lessons   ', '', NULL, 15, 'odissi-mangalacharan-sujata-mohapatra', 'Mangalacharan (Ganesh Vandana) Odissi by Sujata Mohapatra, Choreography Guru Kelucharan Mohapatra', 'Odissi, Mangalacharan, Ganesh Vandana, Sujata Mohapatra, Kelucharan Mohapatra', 'Mangalacharan (Ganesh Vandana) Odissi by Sujata Mohapatra, Choreography Guru Kelucharan Mohapatra  marks the entrance of the dancer on stage in the Odissi style. The dancer invokes the blessings of Lord Jagannath for an auspicious beginning.', 0, '2022-10-12 05:13:59', '171.49.217.187', 0, '2022-10-12 05:14:44', '171.49.217.187', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(72, 8, 0, 'तीन प्रकार के चक्कर', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NRxzoxLyzPQ', 'Guru Pali Chandra explains three different types of Chakkar. It is important to maintain the balance of the body while doing every round in Kathak.      ', '1-10042023125226.jpg', NULL, 16, 'three-types-of-chakkar', 'तीन प्रकार के चक्कर', 'Chakkar, kathak, Excersice, Guru Pali Chandra', 'Three Different types of Chakkars in Kathak', 0, '2023-04-10 12:52:26', '137.97.89.174', 0, '2023-04-11 06:38:17', '137.97.64.176', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(73, 1, 0, 'Gita Govinda Brought To Life In Kathak Idiom', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LoRKAZWeNcg', 'Guru Pali Chandra brings to life Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda in her latest Kathak project. This medieval Masterpiece has been compiled and choreographed in its entirety for the first time in recorded history. This is a unique endeavor, where a special emphasis was laid on cherishing the past glory of a literary work, while interpreting it as per the tastes of a contemporary audience.', '', NULL, 0, 'gita-govinda-in-kathak', 'Gita Govinda Brought To Life In Kathak by Guru Pali Chandra', 'Gita Govinda, Learn dance performance, abhinaya and meaning of all 24 songs of the Gita Govinda, which is considered  a classic of Sanskrit literature. For the first time in history all 24 prabandhs of Gitagovinda composed, choreographed, explained, presented and performed by Kathak Guru Pali Chandra', 'Guru Pali Chandra brings to life Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda in her latest Kathak project. This medieval Masterpiece has been compiled and choreographed in its entirety for the first time in recorded history.', 0, '2023-05-14 07:17:42', '49.37.234.32', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(74, 10, 0, 'Learn Gita Govinda With Guru Pali Chandra', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LoRKAZWeNcg', 'Guru Pali Chandra brings to life Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda in her latest Kathak project. This medieval Masterpiece has been compiled and choreographed in its entirety for the first time in recorded history.', '1-31052023111405.jpg', NULL, 2, 'learn-gita-govinda-with-guru-pali-chandra', 'Learn Gita Govinda With Guru Pali Chandra', 'Gita Govinda, Palichandra, Prabandh, Krishna Radha love, epic', 'Guru Pali Chandra brings to life Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda in her latest Kathak project. This epic poem been compiled and choreographed in its entirety for the first time in history.', 0, '2023-05-31 11:14:06', '49.37.235.73', 0, '2023-08-19 05:28:23', '223.190.207.78', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(75, 10, 0, 'Masterpiece to be launched soon', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GSb0IdwB9tU', 'Guru (Dr.) Pali Chandra shares information about her upcoming Kathak project on the  Gita Govinda. The Guru explains her absence over the last few years, as her regular content cycle was disrupted due to her focusing on a venture she considers her masterpiece.      ', '1-31052023112945.jpg', NULL, 21, 'guru-pali-chandras-latest-masterpiece-to-be-released-soon', 'Guru Pali Chandra\'s Latest Masterpiece to be released soon', 'Gita Govinda, Pali Chandra, Prabandh, Radha Krishna Love, Jayadeva', 'Guru (Dr.) Pali Chandra shares information about her upcoming Kathak project on the  Gita Govinda. The Guru explains her absence over the last few years, as her regular content cycle was disrupted due to her focusing on a venture she considers her masterpiece.', 0, '2023-05-31 11:29:45', '49.37.235.73', 0, '2023-06-06 10:55:11', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(76, 10, 0, 'Gta Govinda Workshop in August 2023', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VYQL10UmyjM', 'Guru Pali Chandra introduces her upcoming Gita Govinda workshop in Kerala. This seven-day Kathak and dance retreat will take place in Thiruvananthapuram on a stage built especially for this production. Spend a week away from the stress and strain of urban life with a holistic vacation in God\'s Own Country. The immersion programme is part of a monumental venture.         ', '1-31052023113359.jpg', NULL, 3, 'experience-jayadevas-gita-govinda-in-the-21st-century', 'Experience Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda in the 21st Century', 'Gita Govinda, Pali Chanda, Jayadeva, 24 Prabandh, Radha Krishna Love', 'Guru Pali Chandra introduces her upcoming Gita Govinda workshop in Kerala. This seven-day Kathak and dance retreat will take place in Thiruvananthapuram.', 0, '2023-05-31 11:33:59', '49.37.235.73', 0, '2023-06-06 10:57:33', '49.37.235.73', 1, '2023-07-03 12:12:05', '223.184.60.29', 2),
(79, 10, 0, 'Challenges in Understanding Gita Govinda', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EVQPPeRKcyw', 'Natyasutra and Kathak maestra Guru (Dr) Pali Chandra have been on a historic endeavour. And together we\'ve created an unparalleled epic for the first time in India\'s cultural history.\r\nIntrigued? Keep following for updates about this classic work.', '', NULL, 16, 'challenges-in-understanding-gita-govinda', 'Guru Pali Chandra\'s Challenges in Understanding Gita Govinda', 'Challenges, Gita Govinda, Guru Pali Chandra, gitagovinda,indian culture,radha krishna love,jayadeva,guru pali chandra,palichandra,kathak,kathak dance,indian classical dance,', 'Guru Pali Chandra\'s Challenges in Understanding Gita Govinda', 0, '2023-06-06 10:24:36', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(77, 10, 0, 'Background of Gita Govinda Project', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q31k7HAqXgk', 'This video contains Kathak maestro Guru Pali Chandra\'s story about her relationship with the Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda. This project is the first complete compilation of the Gita Govinda in Indian history. This 12th-century classic chronicles the eternal and divine relationship between Radha and Lord Krishna. The Guru talks about her journey with the same since a young age and how her pursuit of the complete version over the years led to the upcoming project.   ', '1-01062023052959.jpg', NULL, 19, 'guru-pali-chandra-reveals-the-background-of-her-upcoming-gita-govinda-project', 'Guru Pali Chandra Reveals The Background Of Her Upcoming Gita Govinda Project', 'Gita Govinda, Pali Chandra, Jayadeva, Prabandh, Krishna Radha', 'This video contains Kathak maestro Guru Pali Chandra\'s story about her relationship with the Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda. This project is the first complete compilation of the Gita Govinda in Indian history. T', 0, '2023-06-01 05:29:59', '49.37.235.73', 0, '2023-06-06 10:19:08', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(78, 5, 0, 'Mother Nature Series', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=arPBQI6D6q4', 'On the occasion of World Environment Day, the dance performance by Dr Rajashree Warrier - which handles a subject of topical interest - is creating waves.As the subject of human-animal conflicts becomes more controversial, the famous dancer Dr Rajashree Warrier looks at it from another perspective.\r\n\r\nThis untitled presentation is the first dance video capsule of the Mother Nature Series prepared by Natyasutra - Invis team. The picturisation was done against the backdrop of a Miyawaki forest at Puliyarakonam.', '1-03062023105116.jpg', NULL, 4, 'mother-nature-series', 'Mother Nature Series', 'Mother, Nature, Series, Environment day, June5, Rajashree Warrier,', 'Mother Nature Series: First Dance Video Capsule on World Environment Day by Natyasutra Invis Team', 0, '2023-06-03 10:51:17', '49.37.235.73', 0, '2023-06-07 07:35:28', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(80, 10, 0, 'Behind the scenes (BTS) of Video Production', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ifWjzaVHlOU', 'Over 200 people invested their skills and time to turn the complete Kathak rendition of Gita Govinda into a reality. Here\'s a glimpse of what happened behind the scenes during the production of Natyasutra and Invis\' ambitious project.\r\nGrab the limited-period pre-publication offer on Gita Govinda. Offer valid till August 2023.   ', '', NULL, 10, 'behind-the-scenes-bts-of-gita-govinda', 'Behind the scenes (BTS) of Gita Govinda', 'Behind the scenes , BTS, Gita Govinda, Natyasutra, Invis, kathak dance video,indian culture and tradition,indian cultural heritage, geetha govindam,radhakrishna,love story,love song', 'Here\'s a glimpse of what happened behind the scenes during the production of Natyasutra and Invis\' ambitious project.', 0, '2023-06-06 10:28:21', '49.37.235.73', 0, '2023-06-06 10:57:05', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(81, 10, 0, 'Announcing Gita Govinda by Guru Pali Chandra', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hkq2OeMdRyg', 'Guru Dr Pali Chandra makes an important announcement about her upcoming Gita Govinda project in this video. The  5-year journey to translate and choreograph the entirety of Jayadeva\'s masterpiece is finally over. The Guru shares her thoughts on the process and her time at the special outdoor studio in Thiruvananthapuram.   ', '', NULL, 20, 'announcing-gita-govinda', 'Announcing Gita Govinda, Massive 5 year Project', 'Announcing Gita Govinda, Massive 5 year Project,  Guru Dr Pali Chandra, natyasutra,natyasutraonline,all 24 prabandhs of Gita Govinda', 'Guru Dr Pali Chandra makes an important announcement about her upcoming Gita Govinda project in this video.', 0, '2023-06-06 10:31:48', '49.37.235.73', 0, '2023-06-06 10:55:59', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(82, 8, 0, 'Chaals Demonstration in Kathak', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fI2uOMzJMu0', 'Watch Guru Pali Chandra teach students how to perfect Chaal movements. The students can pick up many valuable pointers over how they need to sharpen their movements and how space needs to be covered in the correct way. This will be of great help to Beginners in Kathak as this interactive session will surely enrich their skill set. \r\n   ', '1-08062023092306.jpg', NULL, 17, 'chaals-demonstration-in-kathak', 'Chaals Demonstration in Kathak', 'Chaals Demonstration in Kathak, Pali Chandra, kathak beginners lessons, learn kathak online, kathak music, guru pali chandra', 'Chaals Demonstration in Kathak for Beginners | Learn Kathak Online | Lesson 52/222', 0, '2023-06-08 07:25:48', '49.37.235.73', 0, '2023-06-08 09:23:06', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(83, 10, 0, 'Why I chose Gita Govinda and Jayadeva', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PvVGGT9j1SI', 'Kathak maestro Guru Pali Chandra reveals why she chose Jayadeva and Gita Govinda as the centrepiece for her upcoming project. The Guru opens up about her journey in the craft, her experiences as part of the Indian diaspora, and her resonance with the subject matter of this poem. Guru Pali Chandra has compiled and choreographed the Gita Govinda in Kathak in its entirety for the first time in recorded history. ', '1-13062023055015.jpg', NULL, 17, 'why-i-chose-gita-govinda-and-jayadeva', 'Why I chose Gita Govinda and Jayadeva', 'Gita Govinda, Palichandra, Prabandh, Krishna Radha love, epic', 'Guru Pali Chandra brings to life Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda in her latest Kathak project. This epic poem been compiled and choreographed in its entirety for the first time in history.', 0, '2023-06-13 05:50:15', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(84, 10, 0, 'Gita Govinda, Cherishing Past Glory of A Literary Work', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FdEyw_0JYxQ', 'Guru Pali Chandra explains how differently Gita Govinda has been written by Poet Jayadeva, when compared with other Epics. The beauty of the creation is intelligible through Guru\'s words.', '1-19062023050056.jpg', NULL, 18, 'gita-govinda-cherishing-past-glory-of-a-literary-work', 'Gita Govinda, Cherishing Past Glory of A Literary Work', 'gita govinda, guru pali chandra, jayadeva, epic, poem, kathak, classical dance, prabandh, choreography', 'Guru Pali Chandra explains how differently Gita Govinda has been written by Poet Jayadeva, when compared with other Epics. The beauty of the creation is intelligible through Guru\'s words.', 0, '2023-06-19 05:00:56', '49.37.235.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(85, 10, 0, 'Gita Govinda: Project Revelation by Guru Pali Chandra', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cVKgtRfm_jY', 'Gita Govinda is a classic work based on the eternal love of Radhakrishna, which has vast possibility even today. It takes a great effort to bring that legendary piece of art into life. Guru Dr. Pali Chandra is eloquent about the team and the great effort behind the visualisation of the Gita Govinda project.', '1-03072023103017.jpg', NULL, 15, 'gita-govinda-project-revelation-by-guru-pali-chandra', 'Gita Govinda: Project Revelation by Guru Pali Chandra', 'gitagovinda, gurupalichandra, jayadeva, gitagovindam, geethagovindam, geetagovinda, indianmusic, kathak, natyasutra, natyasutraonline, indianclassicaldance, indianclassicalmusic, indianhistoryandculture, classicaldance, classicaldancelover, team, indianepic, indianarts, indianart, indianart, ourcultureourpride, eternallove, radhakrishna, radhakrishnalove', 'Gita Govinda is a classic work based on the eternal love of Radhakrishna, which has vast possibility even today. It takes a great effort to bring that legendary piece of art into life. Guru Dr. Pali Chandra is eloquent about the team and the great effort behind the visualisation of the Gita Govinda project.', 0, '2023-07-03 10:30:17', '223.184.60.29', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(86, 10, 0, 'The Role of Radha in Gita Govinda', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g8rbtog0WcA', 'Guru Pali Chandra is beautifully explaining the role of Radha in the ancient Epic, Gita Govinda. In this video, Guru says how Radha is being born through the 12th Century work of Jayadeva and through his lyrical beauty. Watch the video to find out how the poet\'s magical words has brought life to the character.   ', '1-19072023114808.jpg', NULL, 14, 'the-role-of-radha-in-gita-govinda', 'The Role of Radha in Gita Govinda | Radha Being Reborn | Guru Pali Chandra | Poet Jayadeva', '#gitagovinda #gurupalichandra #kathak #radhakrishna #poetry #jayadeva #epic #poetjayadeva #lovestory #learnkathakonline #natyasutra #natyasutraonline', 'Guru Pali Chandra is beautifully explaining the role of Radha in the ancient Epic, Gita Govinda. In this video, Guru says how Radha is being born through the 12th Century work of Jayadeva and through his lyrical beauty.', 0, '2023-07-19 11:48:09', '223.184.62.73', 0, '2023-07-19 11:58:45', '223.184.62.73', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(87, 10, 0, 'Journey Through Seven days of Gita Govinda Residential Workshop', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SZHeTM9naaI&feature=youtu.be', 'Guru PAli Chandra', '1-16082023071542.jpg', NULL, 0, 'journey-through-seven-days-of-gita-govinda-residential-workshop', 'Journey Through Seven days of Gita Govinda Residential Workshop', 'Guru PAli Chandra', 'Guru PAli Chandra', 0, '2023-08-16 07:15:42', '110.225.146.240', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 10, '2023-08-16 07:59:50', '110.225.146.240', 2),
(88, 10, 0, 'Highlights of Gita Govinda 7 day Workshop', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dOKnb1t0Boo', 'The students spent a week with Guru Pali Chandra, reliving the magic of Poet Jayadeva\'s masterpiece Gita Govinda in a medieval environment fine-tuned to their specific needs. Participants left the sessions feeling invigorated and with a closer bond with themselves and their roots.\r\n\r\nA a seven-day session, where experts at the Miyawaki Memorial Natural Lab in Thiruvananthapuram trained students from across the globe. Kutiyattam icon Sivan Namboodiri showcased the nuances of stage performance, while award-winning photographer Balan Madhavan guided them through the nuances of his art form. Similarly, renowned Indian classical music singer Renjith aided the group in honing their vocals, while Ayurveda practitioner Sunil Kaimal informed them of the need for correct body conditioning. The students also discussed their impact and duty towards nature with environmentalist M.R. Hari.  \r\n\r\nThis project represents half a decade of planning by the entire team at Natyasutraonline, including the design, logistics and artist training.', '1-17082023094042.jpg', NULL, 13, 'highlights-of-7-day-immersion-residential-workshop-by-guru-pali-chandra', 'Highlights of 7 day Immersion Workshop | Gita Govinda | Kathak', 'gita govinda, poet jayadeva, \r\n jayadeva\'s gita govinda, guru pali chandra, natyasutra, natyasutra online, learn kathak online, kathak dance workshop, gita govinda a lyrical poem by poet jayadeva, poem, poet, kathak, gita govinda workshop', 'The students spent a week with Guru Pali Chandra, reliving the magic of Poet Jayadeva\'s masterpiece Gita Govinda in a medieval environment fine-tuned to their specific needs. Participants left the sessions feeling invigorated and with a closer bond with themselves and their roots.', 0, '2023-08-17 09:40:42', '223.190.207.78', 0, '2023-08-19 05:29:49', '223.190.207.78', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(89, 10, 0, 'Gita Govinda: Musical Journey', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lc_n-WsMgYU', 'The Music and the Composition is very essential to bring a poetic work alive. Guru Dr Pali Chandra explains about the Musical complexities of Gita Govinda based on the mood of the characters in the poem. Poet Jayadeva\'s 12th Century lyrical poem Gita Govinda were brought to life by many legendary musicians such as Balamurali Krishna, Kelucharan Mohapatra, Birju Maharaj, Pandit Jasraj etc,. The different Ragas and the Talas, were chosen as per the suggestions stated by the poet. This shows how clear visioned Jayadeva was about his work.', '1-24082023051201.jpg', NULL, 11, 'gita-govinda-musical-journey-by-guru-pali-chandra', 'Gita Govinda: Musical Journey by Guru Pali Chandra | Music, Ragas and Composition | Kathak Dance', 'gurupalichandra, gitagovinda, kathak, raga, tala, composition, music, jayadeva, poetry, balamuralikrishna, kelucharanmohapatra, panditjasraj, natyasutra, natyasutraonline, ourcultureourpride, indianclassicaldance', 'The Music and the Composition is very essential to bring a poetic work alive. Guru Dr Pali Chandra explains about the Musical complexities of Gita Govinda based on the mood of the characters in the poem.', 0, '2023-08-24 05:12:01', '27.57.20.250', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(90, 5, 0, 'Happy Onam From The Heart of Kerala-Dr Neena Prasad', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuqV8VV1nnU&ab_channel=natyasutra', 'Traditional Onam wishes in authentic Kerala style. Team Natyasutra wishes its patrons a happy and prosperous Onam, a festival born in Kerala that is today truly a global celebration. As the citizens of Kerala decorate their households to welcome King Mahabali, Mohiniyattam icon Neena Prasad and her disciples showcase visuals that represent the ethos of this beautiful festival. A Happy Onam to all!\r\n\r\nThe vocals that serenade us in this video belong to Madhavan Nampoothiri, while the lyrics for the same were originally crafted by Travancore legend Thirunainar Kurichi Madhavan Nair\r\n', '1-28082023082351.jpg', NULL, 3, 'happy-onam-from-the-heart-of-kerala-dr-neena-prasad', 'Happy Onam From The Heart of Kerala | Dr. Neena Prasad Showcases Ethos of This Beautifual Festival', 'happyonam, kerala culture, kerala dance, athapookalam, kerala tradition, onam special, onappattu, onam song, kerala festivals, natyasutraonline, natyasutra', 'Traditional Onam wishes in authentic Kerala style. Team Natyasutra wishes its patrons a happy and prosperous Onam, a festival born in Kerala that is today truly a global celebration.', 0, '2023-08-28 08:23:51', '116.68.73.131', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(91, 10, 0, 'Challenges in Choreographing 24 Songs: Gita Govinda', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kw1o7k8gf4c', 'Choreographing Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda, for all the 24 Prabandhas, was a big challenge. Guru Dr Pali Chandra scrolls through the efforts behind the composition and she is sharing the magical experience with us. Every Prabandh has eight padhs which is called as Ashtapadi and the Gita Govinda Project included all the Prabandhas and the Ashtapadis in the composition. ', '1-04092023054356.jpg', NULL, 0, 'challenges-in-choreographing-24-songs-gita-govinda', 'Challenges in Choreographing 24 Songs of Gita Govinda by Guru Pali Chandra | Ashtapadi | Kathak', 'gitagovinda, gurupalichandra ,ashtapadi, kathak, dancechoreography, prabandha, challenge, danceeducation, natyasutra, natyasutraonline, learnkathakonline, jayadeva ,indianclassicaldance, danceproject', 'Choreographing Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda, for all the 24 Prabandhas, was a big challenge. Guru Dr Pali Chandra scrolls through the efforts behind the composition and she is sharing the magical experience with us.', 0, '2023-09-04 05:43:56', '223.190.214.230', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 16, '2023-09-04 05:45:03', '223.190.214.230', 2),
(92, 10, 0, 'Challenges in Choreographing 24 Songs: Gita Govinda', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kw1o7k8gf4c', 'Choreographing Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda, for all the 24 Prabandhas, was a big challenge. Guru Dr Pali Chandra scrolls through the efforts behind the composition and she is sharing the magical experience with us. Every Prabandh has eight padhs which is called as Ashtapadi and the Gita Govinda Project included all the Prabandhas and the Ashtapadis in the composition.    ', '1-040920230543561.jpg', NULL, 9, 'challenges-in-choreographing-24-songs-gita-govinda', 'Challenges in Choreographing 24 Songs of Gita Govinda by Guru Pali Chandra | Ashtapadi | Kathak', 'gitagovinda, gurupalichandra ,ashtapadi, kathak, dancechoreography, prabandha, challenge, danceeducation, natyasutra, natyasutraonline, learnkathakonline, jayadeva ,indianclassicaldance, danceproject', 'Choreographing Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda, for all the 24 Prabandhas, was a big challenge. Guru Dr Pali Chandra scrolls through the efforts behind the composition and she is sharing the magical experience with us.', 0, '2023-09-04 05:43:56', '223.190.214.230', 0, '2023-09-04 05:48:04', '223.190.214.230', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(93, 10, 0, 'Natyasutra Reveals Gita Govinda, Indian Literacy Masterpiece', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XAYF5MLxsbA', 'First ever in the history, Guru Dr Pali Chandra\'s  Kathak-based interpretation of Poet Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda is now ready to be unveiled to the world.  About 1000 people have worked relentlessly for 5 long years, without wavering from the sole purpose. Widely considered the finest tale of love, separation and spiritual bliss in literary history, its message is still relevant in an ever-evolving planet.', '1-08092023073643.jpg', NULL, 1, 'natyasutra-reveals-gita-govinda-indian-literacy-masterpiece', 'Guru Pali Chandra Presents Gita Govinda, The Greatest Love Story To The World | 12th Century Poem', 'Gita Govinda, guru pali chandra, jayadeva, prabandh, radha krishna love, kathak', 'First ever in the history, Guru Dr Pali Chandra\'s  Kathak-based interpretation of Poet Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda is now ready to be unveiled to the world.', 0, '2023-09-08 07:36:43', '27.57.0.205', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(94, 10, 0, 'Pasyathi Dishi Dishi Prabandh 12: Gita Govinda', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sOx7YyFkvZM', 'This video contains content from Guru Pali Chandra\'s upcoming Gita Govinda lecture series. This series is based on the 12th Prabandha of Jayadeva\'s masterpiece, Pasyathi Dishi Dishi- Natha Hare Jagannatha Hare. The Guru presents a project that, alongside Natyasutra, took over half a decade to perfect. This specific piece deals with Lord Krishna being informed of the emotional state of Radha. The digital series covers all aspects of the original, with the pain and anguish of separation highlighted throughout the course. This is one part of 24 special courses, representing the first time the complete Gita Govinda was compiled and choreographed. For more updates about this monumental project, stay tuned to Natyasutraonline.', '1-13092023063454.jpg', NULL, 3, 'pasyathi-dishi-dishi-prabandh-12-gita-govinda', 'Learn Pasyathi Dishi Dishi Prabandh 12 of Gita Govinda with Guru Pali Chandra |Natha Hare Jagannatha', 'gitagovinda, prabandha, jayadeva, gurupalichandra, dancechoreography, digitalart, natyasutraonline, natyasutra', 'This video contains content from Guru Pali Chandra\'s upcoming Gita Govinda lecture series. This series is based on the 12th Prabandha of Jayadeva\'s masterpiece, Pasyathi Dishi Dishi- Natha Hare Jagannatha Hare.', 0, '2023-09-13 06:34:54', '223.184.62.235', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 16, '2023-09-18 05:21:28', '223.190.214.151', 2),
(95, 10, 0, 'Gita Govinda Digital Launch | DD National', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w6RZiX6vE8A', 'DD national News', '', NULL, 0, 'gita-govinda-digital-launch-dd-national', 'Gita Govinda Digital Launch | DD National | DD Good Morning Show', 'Gita Govinda, Guru Pali Chandra, DD National, DD Goodmorning show, Jayadeva, 24 prabandh, radha krishna love, digital launch', 'DD national News', 0, '2023-09-19 05:29:30', '223.190.214.151', 0, '2023-09-19 05:30:36', '223.190.214.151', 10, '2023-09-19 06:03:21', '223.190.214.151', 2),
(96, 5, 0, '2024\'s Nature Canvas, The Woods', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dowLs5UC1HI', 'Unveiling of a stunning digital poster collection called by the renowned Bharatanatyam expert Dr Rajashree Warrier. \'The Woods\' is a beautiful representation of nature, combining Bharatanatyam\'s graceful poses with the woods\' serenity. Dr.  Rajashree\'s vision is a powerful reminder of our relationship with the environment and the need to protect it.    ', '1-08012024081325.jpg', NULL, 2, '2024s-nature-canvas-rajashree-warrier', '2024\'s Nature Canvas, The Woods - Unveiling Dr Rajashree Warrier\'s Stunning Dance Poster Collection', 'Dr Rajashree Warrier,Bharatanatyam dancer,dance teacher,dance poses,The woods,nature,environment,dance representations,Dance Poster Collection,dancing with nature,new year,2024 Nature Canvas,online dnace teaching classes,natyasutraonline,natyasutra', 'Unveiling of a stunning digital poster collection called by the renowned Bharatanatyam expert Dr Rajashree Warrier. \'The Woods\' is a beautiful representation of nature, combining Bharatanatyam\'s graceful poses with the woods\' serenity. Dr.  Rajashree\'s vision is a powerful reminder of our relationship with the environment and the need to protect it.', 0, '2024-01-08 08:13:25', '171.49.179.216', 0, '2024-01-08 08:14:59', '171.49.179.216', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(97, 10, 0, 'From Hurdles to Harmony', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XPGPIROXBoI', 'In this video, renowned Kathak dancer and choreographer Guru Dr Pali Chandra shares the untold story of her Gita Govinda project. This was the first-ever successful attempt at compiling and choreographing the entire Gita Govinda, a masterpiece by Jayadeva. In partnership with Natyasutraonline, Guru Pali Chandra explains the challenges and triumphs encountered while creating this project from scratch, without any prototype or blueprint to rely upon. She also talks about the innovative approaches used for unique sections like \'Poem in Action\' and the hurdles faced during shooting at far-off locations like Ponmudi and Kallar. The team aimed to recreate the natural elements of Jayadeva\'s original masterpiece, and the outdoor shoots added a mystical touch to this artistic endeavour. In the video, we get a behind-the-scenes look at the raw and unscripted experiences that helped shape the Gita Govinda production into a mesmerizing dance odyssey.', '1-23012024092104.jpg', NULL, 12, 'from-hurdles-to-harmony', 'From Hurdles to Harmony | Guru Dr Pali Chandra Shares the Untold story of her Gita Govinda project', 'gita govinda,guru pali chandra,kathak,dance composition,choreography,prabandha,classical dance,challenges in dance choreography,dance education,natyasutra,natyasutra online,learn kathak online,jayadeva,indian classical dance,dance project,shooting challeges,Gita Govinda project', 'In this video, renowned Kathak dancer and choreographer Guru Dr Pali Chandra shares the untold story of her Gita Govinda project. This was the first-ever successful attempt at compiling and choreographing the entire Gita Govinda, a masterpiece by Jayadeva. In partnership with Natyasutraonline, Guru Pali Chandra explains the challenges and triumphs encountered while creating this project from scratch, without any prototype or blueprint to rely upon. She also talks about the innovative approaches used for unique sections like \'Poem in Action\' and the hurdles faced during shooting at far-off locations like Ponmudi and Kallar. The team aimed to recreate the natural elements of Jayadeva\'s original masterpiece, and the outdoor shoots added a mystical touch to this artistic endeavour. In the video, we get a behind-the-scenes look at the raw and unscripted experiences that helped shape the Gita Govinda production into a mesmerizing dance odyssey.', 0, '2024-01-23 09:21:04', '171.76.96.157', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(98, 5, 0, 'Happy Diwali', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D10wBh_QiQo', 'Sending you the best Diwali greetings 2024 with personalized Diwali video wishes and a Festival of Lights video message, filled with joyful Diwali celebration greetings for friends and family; let’s light up your Diwali greetings with music and dance, sharing creative Diwali wishes for everyone through this heartfelt Diwali greetings video!', '', NULL, 1, 'happy-diwali-2024', 'Natyasutra Wishes Everyone A Diwali Wrapped in Joy, Harmony, and Artistic Delight! Happy Diwali 2024', 'diwali, Happy Diwali, Diwali Video greetings, Happy Diwali Wishes 2024, Diwali Greetings for Friends and Family, Festival of Lights Video Message, Joyful Diwali Celebration Greetings, Personalized Diwali Video Wishes, Best Diwali Greetings 2024, Diwali Wishes with Music and Dance, Heartfelt Diwali Greetings Video, Creative Diwali Wishes for Everyone, Light Up Your Diwali Greetings, deepavali, natyasutra, natyasutraonline, indian dance,indian culture,', 'May this Diwali bring new rhythms to your feet and inspiration to your soul. Natyasutra wishing you happiness, health, and beautiful dance journeys ahead.', 0, '2024-10-30 18:49:27', '49.37.227.49', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(99, 8, 0, 'Mangalacharan by Sujata Mohapatra', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=llIxMQT4MUM', 'This marks the entrance of the dancer on stage in the Odissi style. The dancer invokes the blessings of Lord Jagannath for an auspicious beginning. Then the dancer offers salutation to the Mother Earth, the Teacher, and the Accompanist and to the Audience. Then follows a prayer to Lord Ganesh, remover of all obstacles. \r\n\r\nRaga: Megh & Kedar                \r\nTala: Chaturasra Ekatali\r\nChoreography: Guru Kelucharan Mohapatra\r\nMusic: Pandit Bhubaneswar Mishra     ', '1-09052025103359.jpg', NULL, 8, 'mangalacharan-odissi-by-sujata', 'Mangalacharan (Ganesh Vandana) Odissi by Sujata Mohapatra, Choreography Guru Kelucharan Mohapatra', 'Mangalacharan, Ganesh Vandana, Odissi, Sujata  Mohapatra, Guru Kelucharan Mohapatra', 'This marks the entrance of the dancer on stage in the Odissi style. The dancer invokes the blessings of Lord Jagannath for an auspicious beginning. Then the dancer offers salutation to the Mother Earth, the Teacher, and the Accompanist and to the Audience. Then follows a prayer to Lord Ganesh, remover of all obstacles.', 0, '2025-05-09 10:32:45', '157.46.0.127', 0, '2025-05-09 10:42:04', '157.46.0.127', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(100, 12, 0, 'Guru Pranam to Padma Shri Madhavi Mudgal', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5SxoEEW3R28', 'On the auspicious occasion of Guru Purnima, Dr. Neena Prasad, renowned Mohiniyattam exponent and scholar, offers a heartfelt Guru Pranam to Padma Shri Madhavi Mudgal, the celebrated Odissi legend, on behalf of Natyasutraonline for her lifelong dedication to the art of Odissi, from her rich lineage and artistic vision to her enduring role as a performer and teacher. This special moment honours her contribution to Indian classical dance and celebrates the timeless bond between guru and disciple.', '', NULL, 2, 'guru-pranam-madhavi-mudgal', 'Guru Pranam 2025 by Dr. Neena Prasad to Padma Shri Madhavi Mudgal | Natyasutraonline', 'Guru Pranam 2025, Madhavi Mudgal, Dr. Neena Prasad, Natyasutraonline, Guru Purnima, Indian classical dance, Odissi maestro, Mohiniyattam, guru-shishya tradition, tribute to guru, classical dance legends', 'On Guru Purnima 2025, Dr. Neena Prasad honours Odissi legend Padma Shri Madhavi Mudgal with a heartfelt Guru Pranam on behalf of Natyasutraonline, celebrating her rich legacy in Indian classical dance.', 0, '2025-07-10 06:59:49', '49.37.226.46', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(101, 13, 1, 'c1', '<iframe src=\"https://www.facebook.com/plugins/video.php?height=476&href=https://www.facebook.com/reel/1116369940652588/&show_text=false&width=267&t=0\" width=\"267\" height=\"476\" style=\"border:none;overflow:hidden\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowFullScreen=\"true\"></iframe>', '', '1-18102025094504.jpg', NULL, 0, 'tet-page-1', 'tet page 1', 'tet page 1', 'tet page 1', 0, '2025-10-18 09:45:04', '202.88.244.195', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
