(109, 5, 0, 'A Grand Success Story', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1mgKqgqhPWg', 'Guru Pali Chandra sincerely thanks the students and well-wishers who helped us hit the 100,000 milestone. Your unwavering support strengthens our mission to bring the wonders of Kathak into homes worldwide. Our growth is a shared success with every Kathak lover around the globe.', '1-25062026041630.jpg', NULL, 24, 'a-grand-success-story', 'A Grand Success Story: A Day of Joy for Kathak Fans | Nalme\'s Journey with Learn Kathak Online', 'Guru Pali Chandra, Kathak, 100,000 milestone, 100k, students, well-wishers, ancient art form, classical dance, online learning, home learning, global community, Kathak aficionados, shared success, gratitude', 'Guru Pali Chandra warmly thanks our 100,000 students and well-wishers for their support in helping us share the ancient art of Kathak with enthusiasts worldwide.', 0, '2026-06-25 04:16:30', '157.46.10.37', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(110, 5, 0, 'A Kathak Story', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VzA_06FWwZI', 'Kathak maestro Guru Pali Chandra emphasizes that the journey is more important than the destination. Featured on NatyaSutraOnline—a digital platform crucial to preserving classical Indian dance forms—this segment highlights the Guru\'s approach to her art alongside her expert advice for novices.', '1-25062026043528.jpg', NULL, 18, 'a-kathak-story-guru-pali-chandra', 'A Kathak Story: Guru Pali Chandra | Famous Kathak Dancer of Lucknow Gharana | Happy World Dance Day', 'Guru Pali Chandra, Kathak maestro, journey over destination, NatyaSutraOnline, classical Indian dance, dance preservation, online dance classes, artistic philosophy, advice for beginners, novice dancers', '\"Journey over destination.\" That is the core message Kathak maestro Guru Pali Chandra shares with her students. In partnership with NatyaSutraOnline—a platform dedicated to preserving classical Indian dance—she shares her unique artistic philosophy and essential advice for beginners.', 0, '2026-06-25 04:35:28', '157.46.10.37', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(111, 5, 0, 'Dance is Life', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hMhZhuX_ytc', 'Celebrating International Dance Day on April 29th, Guru Pali Chandra shares her personal connection to Nritya, describing dance as a soulful conversation between the performer and their art. Because dance plays a vital role in preserving ancestral stories and redefining culture, NatyaSutraOnline remains committed to protecting this global heritage and sharing it with the world.', '1-25062026043940.jpg', NULL, 7, 'dance-is-life-guru-pali-chandra', 'Dance is Life, A Journey in Nritya with Guru Pali Chandra | Happy World Dance Day', 'Guru Pali Chandra, International Dance Day, April 29, Nritya, Kathak, dance heritage, cultural preservation, NatyaSutraOnline, artistic expression, ancestral stories, dance philosophy', 'To celebrate International Dance Day (April 29th), Kathak maestro Guru Pali Chandra reflects on her organic journey with Nritya—an art form that chose her as a child. Dance doesn\'t just express the soul; it redefines culture and preserves our ancestors\' stories. NatyaSutraOnline is proud to protect this incredible heritage and share it with global audiences.', 0, '2026-06-25 04:39:40', '157.46.10.37', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(112, 10, 0, 'First release of Gita Govinda Project', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r0xYcwpZt8Y', 'We are proud to share an exclusive preview of Guru Pali Chandra\'s upcoming digital lecture series on Jayadeva’s masterpiece, the Gita Govinda.\r\n\r\nThis particular segment focuses on the 12th Prabandh, Pasyathi Dishi Dishi - Natha Hare Jagannatha Hare, which portrays the messenger describing Radha\'s profound grief and separation to Lord Krishna. The project represents over five years of meticulous research and collaboration with Natyasutra.\r\n\r\nComprising 24 specialized courses, this series marks a historic milestone: the first time the entire Gita Govinda has been comprehensively compiled and choreographed for a digital learning platform. For further updates on this monumental release, please visit Natyasutraonline.   ', '1-26062026063603.jpg', NULL, 3, 'first-release-gita-govinda-project-pashyati-dishi-dishi', 'First release of Gita Govinda Project - Pashyati Dishi Dishi, 12th Prabandh by Guru Dr Pali Chandra', 'Guru Pali Chandra, Gita Govinda lecture series, Natyasutraonline, Kathak dance tutorial, Jayadeva Gita Govinda, Pasyathi Dishi Dishi, Indian classical dance, Radha Krishna separation, Ashtapadi choreography', 'Experience the first-ever complete compilation and choreography of Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda. Learn the 12th Prabandh with Guru Pali Chandra.', 0, '2026-06-26 06:06:30', '223.181.14.184', 0, '2026-06-26 06:36:03', '223.181.14.184', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(113, 10, 0, 'Guru Pali Chandra\'s Kathak depiction Sancharad Adhara', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hnfpMMM9ggA', 'We are thrilled to present Guru Pali Chandra\'s Kathak interpretation of Sancharad Adhara (Rase Harimiha), the 5th Prabandha of Jayadeva’s timeless Gita Govinda.\r\n\r\nThis profound segment focuses entirely on Radha’s unyielding devotion and her intricate, poetic retelling of Lord Krishna’s divine form. Guru Pali Chandra utilizes the expressive power of Kathak to highlight the subtle nuances of her passion, illustrating everything from the bamboo flute upon His lips and His exquisite jewelry to the majestic yellow robes and the sandal spot on His forehead.\r\n\r\nAs part of a groundbreaking global initiative, this production contributes to the first-ever complete compilation, translation, and choreography of the Gita Govinda. For further insights and release details, please visit Natyasutraonline.   ', '1-26062026063632.jpg', NULL, 7, 'sancharad-adhara-guru-pali-chandras-kathak-depiction', 'Guru Pali Chandra\'s Kathak depiction Sancharad Adhara | 5th Prabandha of Gita Govinda', 'Guru Pali Chandra, Sancharad Adhara, Rase Harimiha, Gita Govinda 5th Prabandha, Kathak dance online, Jayadeva Ashtapadi choreography, Radha Krishna dance, Natyasutraonline classical dance', 'Watch Guru Pali Chandra’s Kathak interpretation of Sancharad Adhara from the Gita Govinda. Experience Radha’s deep devotion via Natyasutraonline.', 0, '2026-06-26 06:12:46', '223.181.14.184', 0, '2026-06-26 06:36:32', '223.181.14.184', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(114, 10, 0, 'Lalitha Lavanga: Welcoming Spring in Vrindavan with Guru Pali Chandra', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_zBzB4FAkgs', 'Watch Guru Pali Chandra’s digital Kathak lesson on \"Lalitha Lavanga,\" the 3rd Prabandha of Mahakavi Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda celebrating the beauty of Spring. Part of the first-ever complete Gita Govinda choreography series on Natyasutraonline.      ', '1-26062026063703.jpg', NULL, 6, 'lalitha-lavanga-gita-govinda-third-prabandha', 'Lalitha Lavanga, Ode to the Magic of Spring | Welcoming Spring in Vrindavan with Guru Pali Chandra', 'Guru Pali Chandra, Lalitha Lavanga, Gita Govinda 3rd Prabandha, Kathak Spring dance, Jayadeva Ashtapadi tutorial, Natyasutraonline, digital Kathak lessons, learn Indian classical dance online, Lalita Lavanga Lata Parishilana choreography', 'Discover the magic of Spring in Kathak with Guru Pali Chandra\'s Lalitha Lavanga lesson. Part of the historic complete Gita Govinda series on Natyasutraonline.', 0, '2026-06-26 06:17:18', '223.181.14.184', 0, '2026-06-26 09:58:29', '223.181.14.184', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(115, 10, 0, 'Vahathi Malaya Samire...', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pIh6R-vvnpg', 'Watch Guru Pali Chandra’s digital Kathak lecture on Vahathi Malaya Samire, the 10th Prabandha of the Gita Govinda. This lesson captures Lord Krishna\'s separation and longing using the rich flora, fauna, and mythology of Vrindavan. Access this historic complete choreography series at Natyasutraonline.      ', '1-26062026063735.jpg', NULL, 5, 'gita-govinda-tenth-prabandha-vahathi-malaya-samire', 'Learn Gita Govinda 10th Prabandha: Vahathi Malaya Samire | Guru Pali Chandra', 'Guru Pali Chandra, Vahathi Malaya Samire, Thava Virahe Vanamali, Gita Govinda 10th Prabandha, Kathak dance online, Jayadeva Ashtapadi choreography, Krishna in distress dance, Natyasutraonline classical dance, Kamadeva Kathak abhinaya, Vrindavan flora and fauna dance', 'Watch Guru Pali Chandra’s Kathak lecture on Vahathi Malaya Samire. See how Krishna’s distress is beautifully depicted in this historic Gita Govinda series.', 0, '2026-06-26 06:32:49', '223.181.14.184', 0, '2026-06-26 09:53:31', '223.181.14.184', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(116, 10, 0, 'Swan Ki Chaal, Mastering The Grace with Guru Pali Chandra', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kuUyhLF4NhQ', 'Embark on a poetic Kathak journey with Guru Pali Chandra as she brings the 20th Prabandha of Jayadeva’s Gita Govinda to life. In this exclusive lesson on NatyaSutraOnline, the Guru demonstrates the graceful movements of the swan—a timeless symbol of purity and divine love—showcasing her expert storytelling and precise abhinaya.   ', '1-26062026064833.jpg', NULL, 4, 'swan-ki-chal-gitagovinda-pali-chandra', 'Swan Ki Chaal, Mastering The Grace with Guru Pali Chandra\'s Technique in Gita Govinda\'s Prabandha 20', 'Guru Pali Chandra, Gita Govinda Prabandha 20, swan movements in Kathak, NatyaSutraOnline, Jayadeva Ashtapadi choreography, Indian classical dance storytelling, swan dance symbolism, learn Kathak online', 'Watch Guru Pali Chandra depict the graceful movements of a swan in Gita Govinda\'s 20th Prabandha. Learn this poetic Kathak lesson on NatyaSutraOnline.', 0, '2026-06-26 06:48:33', '223.181.14.184', 0, '2026-06-26 09:49:40', '223.181.14.184', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(117, 10, 0, 'Dashavatar from Gita Govinda | A Performance by Disciples of Guru Pali Chandra', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U3lWuN9QTtc', 'Witness a dynamic Kathak performance of \"Pralaya Payodhi Jale\" from Jayadeva\'s Gita Govinda, specifically highlighting the fierce Narasimha Avatar from the Dashavatar. Performed by the talented students of Guru Pali Chandra, this piece brings the divine incarnations of Lord Krishna to life. This production is part of a groundbreaking online dance course featuring all 24 Prabandhas compiled for the very first time. Explore the complete course on NatyasutraOnline!', '1-26062026065217.jpg', NULL, 8, 'dashavatar-gita-govinda-pralaya-payodhi-jale', 'Dashavatar from Gita Govinda | Pralaya Payodhi Jale, A Performance by Deciples of Guru Pali Chandra', 'Pralaya Payodhi Jale Kathak, Narasimha Avatar dance, Dashavatar Gita Govinda, Guru Pali Chandra students, NatyasutraOnline, Jayadeva Dashavatar choreography, Indian classical dance online course, learn Kathak online', 'Watch Guru Pali Chandra\'s students perform the Narasimha Avatar (Pralaya Payodhi Jale) from Gita Govinda. Explore the complete 24-Prabandha course on NatyasutraOnline.', 0, '2026-06-26 06:52:17', '223.181.14.184', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
(118, 12, 0, 'Guru Pranam to Bragha Bessell', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1pxNAZhAJrQ', 'Natyasutra Online honors legendary Bharatanatyam dancer and abhinaya specialist Bragha G. Bessell with the Guru Pranam ceremony this Guru Purnima.   ', '1-20112026025537.jpg', NULL, 1, 'guru-pranam-2026', 'Natyasutra Guru Pranam 2026 | Honouring Bharatanatyam Legend Bragha Bessell', 'Guru Purnima 2026, Bragha G Bessell, Natyasutra Online, Guru Pranam, Bharatanatyam dancer, abhinaya specialist, Dr Rajashree Warrier, Indian classical dance, guru-shishya parampara, Music Academy Chennai, Nritya Kalanidhi', 'Celebrate Guru Purnima with Natyasutra Online\'s annual Guru Pranam ceremony, honoring legendary Bharatanatyam maestro and abhinaya specialist Bragha G. Bessell for her five decades of dedication to Indian classical dance.', 0, '2026-06-29 07:39:56', '223.181.12.45', 0, '2026-11-20 02:55:38', '49.37.225.10', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1),
