 xss=removed></div> <div xss=removed></div></div></a><p xss=removed><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbsGyDtEWOY/?utm_source=ig_embed&utm_campaign=loading\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by NatyaSutra (@natyasutraonline)</a></p></div></blockquote>', 'In this snippet, Guru Sreelakshmy Govardhanan brings alive Krishna the cowherd and his mischievous moments from Dr. M. Balamuralikrishna\'s composition. Thank you to every dancer, student and rasika who watched, practised and shared it.\r\n\r\nLearn the complete Sri Sakala Ganadhipa, with Guru Sreelakshmy Govardhanan, on Natyasutra online.   ', '1-27102026063225.jpg', NULL, 1, 'sri-sakala-ganadhipa-one-million', 'Krishna\'s Playful Leelas in Sri Sakala Ganadhipa | Kuchipudi Teachings by Sreelakshmy Govardhanan', 'Sreelakshmy Govardhanan, Sri Sakala Ganadhipa, Kuchipudi abhinaya lesson, Dr M Balamuralikrishna composition, Lord Krishna cowherd dance, Natyasutra Online dance series, one million views, most viewed vidoes, Classical Indian dance lecture demonstration, Lord Ganesha Hanuman Krishna choreography, Indian classical dance storytelling and expressions, Kuchipudi masterclass online, Sreelakshmy Govardhanan, Sri Sakala Ganadhipa, Kuchipudi abhinaya lesson, Dr M Balamuralikrishna composition, Lord Krishna cowherd dance, Natyasutra Online dance series, Classical Indian dance lecture demonstration, Lord Ganesha Hanuman Krishna choreography, Indian classical dance storytelling and expressions, Kuchipudi masterclass online', 'Explore Lord Krishna\'s playful interludes in this 1M+ viewed Natyasutra lesson by Sreelakshmy Govardhanan on Dr. M. Balamuralikrishna\'s unique composition.', 0, '2026-10-27 06:31:48', '49.37.234.222', 0, '2026-10-27 06:32:25', '49.37.234.222', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1);
