v> <div xss=removed></div></div></a><p xss=removed><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DQvvX9ADzuB/?utm_source=ig_embed&utm_campaign=loading\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by NatyaSutra (@natyasutraonline)</a></p></div></blockquote>', 'Tatkaar forms the foundation of Kathak footwork and is considered the root of the dance form.  Watch Guru Pali Chandra give us a perfect demonstration of Tatkaar (Footwork) – in Teentaal - Ekgun, Dugun, Tigun, Chaugun and Athgun. This video is part of the Intermediate Kathak course in Natyasutraonline, which continues the learning journey from the beginner level and deepens understanding of the art with an advanced perspective guided by Guru Pali Chandra.  This session introduces the learners to applying Tatkaar as both a warm-up and technique-building exercise in Teentaal, helping dancers refine precision before moving into faster compositions and spins.    ', '1-17112026082549.jpg', NULL, 0, 'tatkaar-footwork-demonstration', 'Tatkaar in Teentaal – Kathak Footwork | Guru Pali Chandra', 'Tatkaar, Kathak footwork, Guru Pali Chandra, Teentaal, Ekgun, Dugun, Tigun, Chaugun, Athgun, Intermediate Kathak course, Natyasutraonline, Kathak warm-up, Kathak technique, Indian classical dance, Kathak rhythm, Layakari, online Kathak classes', 'Watch Guru Pali Chandra demonstrate Kathak Tatkaar (footwork) in Teentaal across Ekgun, Dugun, Tigun, Chaugun, and Athgun speeds. Build precision and stamina in this Intermediate Kathak lesson on Natyasutraonline.', 0, '2026-11-17 08:12:38', '49.37.224.51', 0, '2026-11-17 08:25:49', '49.37.224.51', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 1);
